/><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1424"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1424Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1424" /><gams:textualContent>A des milliers de mètres : la mer.Dans les rafales de vent les vagues montaient comme des cyclones et au dedans l'orage grondait, bas et terrible  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1424Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1424Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1424Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1424Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> l'orage grondait, bas et terrible </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> l'orage [v|grondait,|gronder|is] [a|bas|bas|auvnmnnC] et [a|terrible|terrible|ausnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1424Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>grondait,</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gronder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1424Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1424Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>terrible</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#terrible" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1425"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1425Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1425" /><gams:textualContent>Ça y est, elle l’a !Elle gronde bas  , le signal habituel pour prévenir Severus qu'il faut partir.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1425Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1425Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1425Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Elle gronde bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Elle [v|gronde|gronder|is] [a|bas|bas|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1425Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gronde</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gronder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1425Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1426" /><gams:textualContent>Avec la brusquerie propre à cette étrange famille, Steven m’arrache à lui, me tenant par les épaules, me maintenant à distance.Son regard vert planté au fond du mien, j’entends la fureur du volcan gronder , basse , sourde , puissante  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426Ph1Ad3" /><aaif:text>j’entends la fureur du volcan gronder , basse , sourde , puissante </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>j’entends la fureur du volcan [v|gronder|gronder|is] , [a|basse|bas|aavnmnnC] , [a|sourde|sourd|aavnmnnC] , [a|puissante|puissant|aavnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gronder</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gronder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>basse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>sourde</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sourd" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1426Ph1Ad3"><aaif:text>puissante</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#puissant" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1427"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1427Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1427" /><gams:textualContent>Le cas du Bénin voisin de l'Est faisait école.Eyadema va gronder haut et fort  : «Il n'y aura pas de suivisme».</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1427Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1427Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1427Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1427Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Eyadema va gronder haut et fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Eyadema va [v|gronder|gronder|ts] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1427Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gronder</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gronder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1427Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1427Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1428"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1428Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1428" /><gams:textualContent>Je ne peux pas te regarder car le courage me manque, et je ne peux plus te gronder haut et fort  car la dépression me guette.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1428Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1428Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1428Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1428Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>je ne peux plus te gronder haut et fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>je ne peux plus te [v|gronder|gronder|ts] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1428Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gronder</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gronder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1428Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1428Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1429"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1429Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1429" /><gams:textualContent>Ils s'étaient tous levés en entendant les orages et les cris gronder haut dans le ciel.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1429Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1429Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1429Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les cris gronder haut dans le ciel</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les cris [v|gronder|gronder|is] [a|haut|haut|auvnlnnn] dans le ciel</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1429Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gronder</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gronder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1429Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1430"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1430Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1430 /1 (27.5.2015)" /><gams:textualContent>La Peta aura eu beau la gronder haut et fort  , Lady Gaga a fait la sourde oreille...Pour recevoir son Moonman de la Vidéo de l'année (Bad Romance ), la chanteuse avait revêtu sa robe en viande crue.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1430Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1430Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1430Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1430Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>La Peta aura eu beau la gronder haut et fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La Peta aura eu beau la [v|gronder|gronder|ts] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1430Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>gronder</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gronder" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1430Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1430Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1431"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1431Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1431" /><gams:textualContent>En tout cas on voit que ça guerroyait fort  pour que tu aies le temps d'oublier ton armée en chasse</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1431Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1431Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1431Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça guerroyait fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|guerroyait|guerroyer|is] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1431Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>guerroyait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#guerroyer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1431Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1432"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1432Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1432" /><gams:textualContent>Un vrai livre d'Histoire et de Préhistoire, puisque c'est dans cette région que fut découvert des peintures rupestres vieilles de 35000 ans, et les bastides et chateaux fort qui rappellent que l'on guerroyait fort dans cette région riche d'un passé encore présent comme le Pont Valentré, construit pour faciliter l'accès à la ville de Cahors il y a 700 ans vers 1320. </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1432Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1432Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1432Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui rappellent que l'on guerroyait fort dans cette région</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui rappellent que l'on [v|guerroyait|guerroyer|is] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] dans cette région</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1432Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>guerroyait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#guerroyer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1432Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1433" /><gams:textualContent>La fête du Plaix s’est tenue les 16 et 17 août 2012 autour du thème : "Hier en Berry,  se vêtir , s’habiller beau  ..." Le costume berrichon existe-t-il ?&lt;lb/&gt;Pas peur qu'elle te tire dessus?Et que tu sois sa première victime?!Et qui te dit que je ne suis pas canon moi aussi lol Alors là, incompatibilité totale entre 2 canons, ça risque de guerroyer fort  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> se vêtir , s’habiller beau </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|se vêtir|vêtir|rs] , [v|s’habiller|habiller|rs] [a|beau|beau|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se vêtir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vêtir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>s’habiller</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>beau</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça risque de guerroyer fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça risque de [v|guerroyer|guerroyer|is] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>guerroyer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#guerroyer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1433Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1434"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1434Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1434" /><gams:textualContent>Avec Chictypes.com, les hommes ne subissent plus le douloureux passage du magasin pour s’habiller beau et bien </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1434Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1434Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1434Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pour s’habiller beau et bien</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pour [v|s’habiller|habiller|rs] [a|beau|beau|ausnmnnC] et bien</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1434Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s’habiller</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1434Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>beau</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1435" /><gams:textualContent>De toute facon la Norvege n'est pas le pays de la mode.....on s'habille utile avant de s'habiller beau  .De toute facon le beau norvegien ne coincide pas avec le beau francais.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>on s'habille utile avant de s'habiller beau </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>on [v|s'habille|habiller|rs] [a|utile|utile|auonmnnn] avant de [v|s'habiller|habiller|rs] [a|beau|beau|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s'habille</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>s'habiller</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>utile</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#utile" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1435Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>beau</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1436"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1436Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1436" /><gams:textualContent>La rentrée est derrière nous mais l'hiver approche...Si la garde-robe de vos bouts de chou n'est pas encore complète, voici quelques adresses milanaises très utiles pour les habiller beau et pas cher  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1436Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1436Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1436Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1436Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>pour les habiller beau et pas cher </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pour les [v|habiller|habiller|ts] [a|beau|beau|auonmnnC] et pas [a|cher|cher|auommnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1436Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habiller</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1436Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>beau</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1436Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>cher</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1437"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1437Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1437" /><gams:textualContent>J'aime faire ces belles promenades avec vous.Même la poupée s'habille belle  !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1437Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1437Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1437Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la poupée s'habille belle </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la poupée [v|s'habille|habiller|rs] [a|belle|beau|aasnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1437Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s'habille</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1437Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>belle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1438" /><gams:textualContent> S'habiller  classique , c'est s'habiller vieux  , démodé, couleurs ternes ou banales genre jupe bleue marine et chemisier blanc ou beige.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> S'habiller  classique , c'est s'habiller vieux </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|S'habiller|habiller|rs]  [a|classique|classique|ausnmnnn] , c'est [v|s'habiller|habiller|rs] [a|vieux|vieux|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>S'habiller</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>s'habiller</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>classique</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#classique" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1438Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>vieux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vieux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1439"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1439Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1439" /><gams:textualContent>Pour ce qui est des affaires, je pense qu'il faut s'habiller relativement classique  mais il surtout se sentir bien dans ce que l'on porte : les filles, ne mettez pas des talons si vous n'en portez jamais par exemple.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1439Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1439Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1439Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>je pense qu'il faut s'habiller relativement classique </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>je pense qu'il faut [v|s'habiller|habiller|rs] relativement [a|classique|classique|ausmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1439Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s'habiller</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1439Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>classique</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#classique" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1440"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1440Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1440" /><gams:textualContent>zaza on a les mêmes gouts je crois, moi j'aime bien les habiller classique mes garcons, j'aime pas trop les fringues avec des gros bonhommes disney ou autres</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1440Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1440Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1440Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>j'aime bien les habiller classique mes garcons</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>j'aime bien les [v|habiller|habiller|ts] [a|classique|classique|auonmnnn] mes garcons</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1440Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habiller</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1440Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>classique</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#classique" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1441"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1441Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1441" /><gams:textualContent>et bien su tu n'as jamais mis les pieds du coté des tous petis, c'est un tors...y'en a pour tous les gouts, à petits prix...on peut les habiller "classiques" , "branchés"  ...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1441Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1441Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1441Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1441Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>on peut les habiller \"classiques\" , \"branchés\" </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>on peut les [v|habiller|habiller|ts] [a|\"classiques\"|classique|auonmnnC] , [a|\"branchés\"|branché|auonmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1441Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>habiller</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#habiller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aa