se rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1813Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1813Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1813Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle marche forte </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|marche|marcher|is] [a|forte|fort|aavnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1813Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marche</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1813Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>forte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1814"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1814Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1821" /><gams:textualContent>Definition d'un drag de campagne:&lt;lb/&gt;Stock: si y voit rien c'est stock&lt;lb/&gt;Amélioré: si on en voit un peu, c'est amélioré&lt;lb/&gt;Improve: quand ca a d'l'air de marcher gros  , c'est improve...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1814Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1814Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1814Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ca a d'l'air de marcher gros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ca a d'l'air de [v|marcher|marcher|is] [a|gros|gros|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1814Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marcher</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1814Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1815"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1815Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1822" /><gams:textualContent>la vague à laquelle je pense, et je pense que wilbur parle de la même, est assez longue et creuse.La lèvre jette bien jusqu'en bas, et vu du bord je dirais qu'elle ouvre sur une bonne centaine de mètres.Le problème c'est qu'elle est loin du bord, en pleine eau, donc line up difficile, et quand elle marche gros  c'est généralement accompagné de vent de SW modéré voire plus rendant le placement encore plus difficile.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1815Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1815Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1815Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle marche gros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|marche|marcher|is] [a|gros|gros|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1815Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marche</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1815Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1816"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1816Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1823" /><gams:textualContent>Pour Manon et Gabriel qui demandent aujourd'hui le baptême, et pour Nicole qui entre en catéchuménat.Qu'ils marchent joyeux  à la rencontre de ton Fils, le cœur ouvert à ta Parole et à ta grâce, Père, nous te prions.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1816Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1816Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1816Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ils marchent joyeux </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ils [v|marchent|marcher|is] [a|joyeux|joyeux|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1816Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1816Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>joyeux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#joyeux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1824" /><gams:textualContent>Soweto, il y a 34 ans jour pour jour, vers 9 a.m., des milliers d’enfants « descendaient dans la rue », protestant contre l'imposition de l'enseignement exclusif en langue afrikaans.C’était pacifique.Des milliers d’écoliers de Diekloof (où nous enseignions) marchent joyeux , déterminés , politisés , responsables  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1Ad3" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1Ad4" /><aaif:text>Des milliers d’écoliers de Diekloof (où nous enseignions) marchent joyeux , déterminés , politisés , responsables </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Des milliers d’écoliers de Diekloof (où nous enseignions) [v|marchent|marcher|is] [a|joyeux|joyeux|aisnmnnC] , [a|déterminés|déterminé|aisnmnnC] , [a|politisés|politisé|aisnmnnC] , [a|responsables|responsable|aisnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>joyeux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#joyeux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>déterminés</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#déterminé" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1Ad3"><aaif:text>politisés</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#politisé" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1817Ph1Ad4"><aaif:text>responsables</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#responsable" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">5</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1818"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1818Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1825" /><gams:textualContent>Il est et sera acte de réparation et de guérison pour la lignée des femmes dont elle est issue, afin qu’elle marche joyeuse  vers son accomplissement.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1818Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1818Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1818Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle marche joyeuse </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|marche|marcher|is] [a|joyeuse|joyeux|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1818Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marche</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1818Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>joyeuse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#joyeux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1826" /><gams:textualContent>Lorsque la jument ne faisait pas d'épaule en dedans, quelle marchait droit  , elle demandait quand même que le cheval ait le bout du nez à l'intérieur...lorsqu'il marchait large  ...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle marchait droit </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|droit|droit|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>il marchait large </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|large|large|auvnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1819Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>large</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#large" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1820"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1820Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1827" /><gams:textualContent>Et pendant la séance, elle se reposait trop sur le moniteur, elle ne prenait aucune initiative (par exemple doubler pour faire un appuyer), il fallait que le moniteur lui dise tout sinon elle marchait large autour du manège...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1820Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1820Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1820Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle marchait large autour du manège</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|large|large|auvnlnnn] autour du manège</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1820Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1820Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>large</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#large" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1821"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1821Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1828" /><gams:textualContent>Dans cette épreuve les concurrentes marchent large  toutes ensembles aux deux mains et aux trois allures.Les juges sont au milieu de la carrière et font leurs premières observations.Ce sont eux qui donnent les indications à suivre pour cet examen d’ensemble : trot, galop, changement de main.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1821Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1821Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1821Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les concurrentes marchent large </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les concurrentes [v|marchent|marcher|is] [a|large|large|auvnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1821Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1821Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>large</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#large" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1822"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1822Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1829" /><gams:textualContent>Gaucher, le fidèle, silencieux, comme souvent, portait un lourd épieu, précaution necessaire si d'aventure ils venaient à croiser un sanglier.Condat, à l'inverse, marchait léger  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1822Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1822Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1822Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Condat, à l'inverse, marchait léger </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Condat, à l'inverse, [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|léger|léger|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1822Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1822Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>léger</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#léger" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1823"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1823Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1830" /><gams:textualContent>Elle avait 6 mois, pesait 3 livres.En quelques mois elle atteignit 7 kilos mais " marchait  léger  ".</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1823Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1823Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1823Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle atteignit 7 kilos mais \" marchait  léger </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle atteignit 7 kilos mais \" [v|marchait|marcher|is]  [a|léger|léger|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1823Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1823Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>léger</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#léger" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1824"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1824Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1831" /><gams:textualContent>Elle marchait légère comme une plume, avait un appétit d’oiseau, faisait preuve d’une grande distinction.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1824Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1824Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1824Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Elle marchait légère comme une plume</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Elle [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|légère|léger|aasnmnnn] comme une plume</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1824Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1824Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>légère</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#léger" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1825"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1825Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1832" /><gams:textualContent>pour l'annecdote, j'avais installé jaguar sur mon bondi blue avec 96 Mo et cela marchait ! ( lent , mais cela marchait)...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1825Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1825Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1825Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cela marchait ! ( lent , mais cela marchait)</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cela [v|marchait|marcher|is] ! ( [a|lent|lent|auvntnnn] , mais cela marchait)</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1825Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1825Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>lent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lent" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1833" /><gams:textualContent>Je ne pouvais pas marcher vite  , parce que lui, il marchait lent comme une tortue.Il regardait tout ce qu'il y avait autour de lui.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Je ne pouvais pas marcher vite </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Je ne pouvais pas [v|marcher|marcher|is] [a|vite|vite|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marcher</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>vite</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vite" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>il marchait lent comme une tortue</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|lent|lent|ausnmnnn] comme une tortue</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1826Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>lent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lent" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1827"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1827Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1834" /><gams:textualContent>J'ai apercu une madame qui s'en venait vers nous et qui marchait lent.Très lent  .Comme les meurtriers dans les films d'horreur!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1827Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1827Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1827Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui marchait lent.Très lent </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui [v|marchait|marcher|is] lent.Très [a|lent|lent|auvmmrnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1827Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1827Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>lent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lent" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1828"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1828Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1836" /><gams:textualContent>Si elle lit ta lettre, elle t'aime toujours, malgré que tout marchait mauvais  pour nous deux.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1828Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1828Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1828Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tout marchait mauvais </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tout [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|mauvais|mauvais|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1828Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1828Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>mauvais</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mauvais" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1829"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1829Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1837" /><gams:textualContent>Benzema la cerise sur le punding, un attaquant qui n'est jamais dans la surface et joue comme un 10 en marchant mauvais même dans ses passes et j'arrête la car je vais être malpoli</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1829Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1829Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1829Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>un attaquant qui n'est jamais dans la surface et joue comme un 10 en marchant mauvais même dans ses passes</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>un attaquant qui n'est jamais dans la surface et joue comme un 10 en [v|marchant|marcher|is] [a|mauvais|mauvais|auvnmnnn] même dans ses passes</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1829Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1829Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>mauvais</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mauvais" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1830"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1830Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1838" /><gams:textualContent>Il marchait mou  , la tête ailleurs, le teint malade.Les seuls sons qui sortaient de sa bouche étaient des soupirs à vous arracher le cœur, des soupirs de désespoir qui créaient une atmosphère insoutenable.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1830Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1830Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1830Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Il marchait mou </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Il [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|mou|mou|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1830Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1830Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>mou</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mou" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1839 -" /><gams:textualContent>Flavien: Non non non non...C'est juste que vous marchez mou ... Mais tant qu'à ça moi aussi je marche mou  hein...&lt;lb/&gt;-Capitaine: Et puis, des commentaires?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>vous marchez mou </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>vous [v|marchez|marcher|is] [a|mou|mou|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchez</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>mou</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mou" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>je marche mou </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>je [v|marche|marcher|is] [a|mou|mou|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>marche</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1831Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>mou</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mou" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1832"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1832Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1840" /><gams:textualContent>vous croyez qu'il est heureux de vous voir, sans prudence vous avancez votre main et vlam un coup de patte!!vous le croyez indifférent, il marche noble devant vous, il se retourne et vient faire un câlin!!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1832Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1832Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1832Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>il marche noble devant vous</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il [v|marche|marcher|is] [a|noble|noble|ausnmnnn] devant vous</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1832Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marche</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1832Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>noble</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#noble" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1833"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1833Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1841" /><gams:textualContent>Hinata et lui marchèrent pesant vingt minutes avant de se séparer à une intersection.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1833Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1833Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1833Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Hinata et lui marchèrent pesant vingt minutes</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Hinata et lui [v|marchèrent|marcher|is] [a|pesant|pesant|ausnmnnn] vingt minutes</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1833Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchèrent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1833Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>pesant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pesant" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1834"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1834Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1842" /><gams:textualContent>J'avais 5 femelles dans mes pommes et un beau 8 pointes a passé a coté de moi a 20 metres, mais du bord opposé que je tire je suis gaucher.Je l'avais entendu marcher, mais y en avais un qui s en venait aux pommes (je ne le voyais pas) qui marchait pesant  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1834Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1834Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1834Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui marchait pesant </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|pesant|pesant|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1834Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1834Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>pesant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pesant" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1835"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1835Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1843" /><gams:textualContent>Elle marchait, rapide  , dans le matin clair, arpentant le trottoir, traversant à grand pas les avenues en relevant d'une main légère une mèche de cheveux rebelles qui lui tombait sur les yeux.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1835Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1835Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1835Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Elle marchait, rapide </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Elle [v|marchait,|marcher|is] [a|rapide|rapide|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1835Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait,</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1835Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rapide</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rapide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1836"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1836Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1844" /><gams:textualContent>En rênes longues, elle marchait rapide  mais elle marchait.Et au galop, au taquet bien sûr !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1836Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1836Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1836Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle marchait rapide </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|rapide|rapide|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1836Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1836Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rapide</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rapide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1837"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1837Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1845" /><gams:textualContent>On a fait environ … je dirais 2 km en exactement 30 min.Rendue a la fin je devais faire du jogging pour etre capable de tenir leur rythme (qui soit dit en passant elles marchaient rapide  … mais marchaient!!)</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1837Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1837Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1837Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elles marchaient rapide </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elles [v|marchaient|marcher|is] [a|rapide|rapide|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1837Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchaient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1837Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rapide</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rapide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1838"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1838Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1846" /><gams:textualContent>Merci pour cette proposition, ils marchaient rapides  pour des zombies, c'était pas évident.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1838Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1838Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1838Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ils marchaient rapides </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ils [v|marchaient|marcher|is] [a|rapides|rapide|aisnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1838Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchaient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1838Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rapides</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rapide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1839"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1839Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1847" /><gams:textualContent>J'ajoute que ce n'est pas nouveau, nos ancêtres les romains, peut-être les gaulois, les mérovingiens, et jusqu'au moyen âge portaient des "bandes molletières"...C'est que ça marchait sec  à ces époques dans la piétaille.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1839Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1839Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1839Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça marchait sec </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|sec|sec|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1839Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1839Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>sec</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sec" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1840"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1840Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1848" /><gams:textualContent>En fait, la console s'allumait a froid...mais aucun affichage.Une fois chaude, ca beigne...ca marchait sec  .Sinon, ca fesait du bruit, oui j'insiste...(c'est pas le lecteur DVD qu'on entend...mais les turbines du processeur)</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1840Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1840Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1840Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ca marchait sec </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ca [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|sec|sec|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1840Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1840Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>sec</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sec" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1841"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1841Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1849" /><gams:textualContent>Puis revendue car consommation importante à... un préparateur de rally...Le mec a détecté tout de suite lors de l'essai qu'elle marchait sec  à côté d'une s16 full stock</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1841Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1841Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1841Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle marchait sec </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|marchait|marcher|is] [a|sec|sec|ausnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1841Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1841Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>sec</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sec" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1842"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1842Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1850" /><gams:textualContent>Comment tu fait donc pour armer la pompe sans qu'elle marche sèche  trop long temps (la pression du réseau d'eau aide!)?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1842Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1842Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1842Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle marche sèche </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|marche|marcher|is] [a|sèche|sec|aasnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1842Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marche</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1842Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>sèche</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sec" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1843"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1843Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1851" /><gams:textualContent>Les élèves marchaient serré sur un étroit chemin escarpé.Ils débouchèrent bientôt sur la rive d’un lac noir.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1843Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1843Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1843Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Les élèves marchaient serré sur un étroit chemin</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Les élèves [v|marchaient|marcher|is] [a|serré|serré|ausnlnnn] sur un étroit chemin</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1843Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchaient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1843Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>serré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serré" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1844"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1844Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1852" /><gams:textualContent>Harry cru reconnaître deux des six élèves qui venaient s’aventurer par ici : Ginny et Dean.Ils se tenaient la main et marchaient serré l'un contre l'autre.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1844Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1844Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1844Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ils se tenaient la main et marchaient serré l'un contre l'autre</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ils se tenaient la main et [v|marchaient|marcher|is] [a|serré|serré|ausnlnnn] l'un contre l'autre</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1844Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchaient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1844Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>serré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serré" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1845"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1845Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1853" /><gams:textualContent>Lors de mon précédent voyage ici, au sud-ouest de l’Afrique, un jeune Namibien m’avait demandé s’il était vrai qu’en Hollande, des gens marchaient serrés sur des trottoirs .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1845Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1845Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1845Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>des gens marchaient serrés sur des trottoirs</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>des gens [v|marchaient|marcher|is] [a|serrés|serré|aisnlnnn] sur des trottoirs</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1845Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchaient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1845Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>serrés</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serré" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1846"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1846Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1854" /><gams:textualContent>Et encore faut qui aient les couilles d'aller juska se battre.Des gars i se sont jms battus a 18 pij, i poussent 6mois a la salle tu les vois dans la rue i marchent sur d'eux i regardent les gens dans les yeux énervés :D</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1846Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1846Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1846Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Des gars i se sont jms battus a 18 pij, i poussent 6mois a la salle tu les vois dans la rue i marchent sur d'eux</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Des gars i se sont jms battus a 18 pij, i poussent 6mois a la salle tu les vois dans la rue i [v|marchent|marcher|is] [a|sur|sûr|ausnmnnn] d'eux</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1846Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1846Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>sur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sûr" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1847"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1847Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1855" /><gams:textualContent>Les trois amis marchaient, sûr d'eux , prêt à tout pour découvrir la vérité !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1847Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1847Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1847Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Les trois amis marchaient, sûr d'eux</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Les trois amis [v|marchaient,|marcher|is] [a|sûr|sûr|ausnmnnn] d'eux</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1847Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchaient,</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1847Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>sûr</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sûr" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1848"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1848Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1856" /><gams:textualContent>Viennent ensuite les soldats, qui paraissent si tranquilles.Cachés par leurs casques, ils marchent , sûrs d’eux. </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1848Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1848Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1848Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ils marchent , sûrs d’eux.</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ils [v|marchent|marcher|is] , [a|sûrs|sûr|aisnmnnn] d’eux.</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1848Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1848Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>sûrs</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sûr" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1849"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1849Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1857" /><gams:textualContent>La jeune femme marchait , sûre de son effet , sac à main au bras et bonnet vissé sur la tête.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1849Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1849Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1849Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>La jeune femme marchait , sûre de son effet</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La jeune femme [v|marchait|marcher|is] , [a|sûre|sûr|aisnmnnn] de son effet</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1849Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1849Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>sûre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sûr" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1858" /><gams:textualContent>Moi j ai un 6900 kv dans mon b44 qui est l equivalent a un 6.5t pis faut je check mais temp beaucoup car ya envie de chauffer rapidement...Un 3.5 equivaut a 10500 kv sa doit marcher terrible mais sa doit chauffer terrible  aussi!!!!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>sa doit marcher terrible mais sa doit chauffer terrible </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>sa doit [v|marcher|marcher|is] [a|terrible|terrible|auvnmnnn] mais sa doit [v|chauffer|chauffer|is] [a|terrible|terrible|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marcher</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>chauffer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#chauffer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>terrible</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#terrible" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1850Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>terrible</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#terrible" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1851"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1851Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1859" /><gams:textualContent>j'ai reçu mes atos concorde ils se sont trompés en m'envoyant des onyx au lieux des titanes et par chance elles marchent terrible  même a la cartouche.alors la question est est-ce que les titanes seraient de moins bonne qualité ???</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1851Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1851Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1851Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elles marchent terrible </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elles [v|marchent|marcher|is] [a|terrible|terrible|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1851Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1851Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>terrible</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#terrible" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1852"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1852Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1860" /><gams:textualContent>Perso, j'ai des enceintes acoustics Energy AEVO 3 (compte 600€ la paire) qui marchent terrible  !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1852Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1852Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1852Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> qui marchent terrible </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> qui [v|marchent|marcher|is] [a|terrible|terrible|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1852Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1852Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>terrible</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#terrible" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1853"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1853Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1861" /><gams:textualContent>Salut, j ai suivi tes conseils sur mon rsst acquis chez notre ami d espace vap et ses conseils pour mon A8 version2,lol,et bien j ai deux superbe atos qui marchent terribles  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1853Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1853Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1853Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>atos qui marchent terribles </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>atos qui [v|marchent|marcher|is] [a|terribles|terrible|aivnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1853Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marchent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marcher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1853Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>terribles</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#terrible" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1854"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1854Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1862" /><gams:textualContent>Je marmotte tout bas les mots de "crampon" et de "sale caractère".Et puis je hausse les épaules et je caresse la dure tête ronde, toute chaude, qui se glisse sous ma main, et je la plains, et je la console.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1854Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1854Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1854Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Je marmotte tout bas les mots</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Je [v|marmotte|marmotter|ts] tout [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] les mots</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1854Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marmotte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marmotter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1854Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1855"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1855Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1863" /><gams:textualContent>- C'est ca et moi je suis la fille de Merlin, marmotta tout bas Samaliha.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1855Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1855Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1855Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>C'est ca et moi je suis la fille de Merlin, marmotta tout bas Samaliha</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>C'est ca et moi je suis la fille de Merlin, [v|marmotta|marmotter|ts] tout [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] Samaliha</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1855Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marmotta</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marmotter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1855Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1856"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1856Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1864" /><gams:textualContent>Sur le vernis, je dirais que c'est le carrossier qui doit décider, mais une chose est sûre, ces couches de bi-composant sont relativement épaisses et il ne sert à rien de surenchérir sur le nombre de couches pour un usage domestique du flip!Il faut bien voir que plus la couche de vernis sera épaisse, plus les airballs vont marquer profond  , plus le sèchage sera long, aussi, etc.....</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1856Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1856Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1856Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les airballs vont marquer profond </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les airballs vont [v|marquer|marquer|ts] [a|profond|profond|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1856Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marquer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marquer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1856Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>profond</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#profond" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1857"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1857Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1865" /><gams:textualContent>Concernant les lames de swivel en céramique, il me semble avoir lu que ça coupait trop.Le but du swivel n'étant pas d'inciser le fleur, mais juste de la marquer profond  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1857Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1857Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1857Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>mais juste de la marquer profond </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>mais juste de la [v|marquer|marquer|ts] [a|profond|profond|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1857Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marquer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marquer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1857Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>profond</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#profond" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1858"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1858Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1866" /><gams:textualContent>et tu passes en akra quand ?;p tu feras gaffe a ce que les caches en metal ne touchent pas les pots sinon ça va les marquer profond  !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1858Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1858Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1858Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça va les marquer profond </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça va les [v|marquer|marquer|ts] [a|profond|profond|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1858Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>marquer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#marquer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1858Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>profond</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#profond" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1859"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1859Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1867" /><gams:textualContent>Oui, le jeune schtroumpf bien tendre, ça se laisse manger, les vieux machins barbus, en revanche, faut mastiquer ferme  ....</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1859Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1859Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1859Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les vieux machins barbus, en revanche, faut mastiquer ferme </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les vieux machins barbus, en revanche, faut [v|mastiquer|mastiquer|ts] [a|ferme|ferme|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1859Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mastiquer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mastiquer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1859Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>ferme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ferme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1860"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1860Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1868" /><gams:textualContent>Quant à toi qui uses de locutions latines, vilipendes nos compatriotes qui infiltrent Paris sacs suspendus au dos, je te vois en train de mastiquer ferme ces cacahuètes bon marché qu'on sert aux badauds dans les galeries parisiennes lors de vernissages...quel snob décidément lol</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1860Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1860Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1860Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>je te vois en train de mastiquer ferme ces cacahuètes</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>je te vois en train de [v|mastiquer|mastiquer|ts] [a|ferme|ferme|auvnqnnn] ces cacahuètes</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1860Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mastiquer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mastiquer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1860Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>ferme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ferme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1861"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1861Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1869" /><gams:textualContent>Les trucs curieux sur la 917 Heller, c'est déjà l'a jointure carro-châssis au milieu de la calandre à l'avant, ce qui oblige à mastiquer ferme  pour faire propre.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1861Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1861Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1861Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ce qui oblige à mastiquer ferme </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ce qui oblige à [v|mastiquer|mastiquer|is] [a|ferme|ferme|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1861Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mastiquer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mastiquer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1861Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>ferme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ferme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1870" /><gams:textualContent>Contactez nous et dès que nous serons assez nombreux(ses) nous sortirons un communiqué que nous rédigerons ensemble pour dénoncer tout haut ce machin que beaucoup maudissent tout bas  …</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>pour dénoncer tout haut ce machin que beaucoup maudissent tout bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pour [v|dénoncer|dénoncer|ts] tout [a|haut|haut|auvmmnnn] ce machin que beaucoup [v|maudissent|maudire|ts] tout [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dénoncer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dénoncer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>maudissent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#maudire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1862Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1863"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1863Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1871" /><gams:textualContent>Le risque de se faire humilier, le risque de voir notre « cote de popularité » baisser, le peur de montrer à tous nos faiblesses, tout ceci nous retient à ce masque que nous maudissons tout bas  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1863Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1863Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1863Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ce masque que nous maudissons tout bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ce masque que nous [v|maudissons|maudire|ts] tout [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1863Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>maudissons</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#maudire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1863Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1864"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1864Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1872" /><gams:textualContent>A l'annonce du dernier nom, la quasi-totalité des filles devinrent vertes de jalousie, et regardèrent Leane en la maudissant tout bas , et des rires et ricanements fusèrent : la guerre Blogworth-Black était connue de tous.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1864Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1864Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1864Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en la maudissant tout bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en la [v|maudissant|maudire|ts] tout [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1864Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>maudissant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#maudire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1864Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1865"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1865Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1873" /><gams:textualContent>J'y suis allée à la main, lentement mais en me gardant bien de maudire tout haut le jour où j'avais pleuré devant le père Lorrain.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1865Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1865Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1865Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>de maudire tout haut le jour</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>de [v|maudire|maudire|ts] tout [a|haut|haut|auvmmnnn] le jour</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1865Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>maudire</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#maudire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1865Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1866"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1866Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1874" /><gams:textualContent>Il faudra donc en permanence faire des choix draconiens entre ses priorités, élaborer une stratégie secrête tout en vous retenant de maudire tout haut vos adversaires qui font foirer un plan si bien préparé, ect…</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1866Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1866Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1866Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>de maudire tout haut vos adversaires</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>de [v|maudire|maudire|ts] tout [a|haut|haut|auvmmnnn] vos adversaires</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1866Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>maudire</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#maudire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1866Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1867"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1867Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1875" /><gams:textualContent>C'est reprendre mille fois l'explication du devoir de maths sans se mettre soi-même à  maudire tout haut l'école et les heures de devoir.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1867Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1867Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1867Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> maudire tout haut l'école</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|maudire|maudire|ts] tout [a|haut|haut|auvmmnnn] l'école</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1867Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>maudire</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#maudire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1867Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1868"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1868Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1876" /><gams:textualContent>Je me "mêle fort " ( !!!...) de ce qui ne me regarde pô, mais est-ce que tu as aussi eu le pack "huile...de vidange" pour la voiture avant de partir en vacances ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1868Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1868Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1868Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Je me \"mêle fort \"</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Je [v|me \"mêle|mêler|rs] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] \"</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1868Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>me \"mêle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mêler" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1868Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1869"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1869Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1877" /><gams:textualContent>Il s’est donné à fond pour les Flyers qu’il a tenus à bout de bras pendant un temps.Les commotions l’ont forcé à arrêter, mais il a tout de même joué en dépit des risques et a continué à produire en se mêlant fort au trafique.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1869Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1869Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1869Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>produire en se mêlant fort au trafique</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>produire en [v|se mêlant|mêler|rs] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] au trafique</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1869Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se mêlant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mêler" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1869Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1870"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1870Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1878" /><gams:textualContent>Les habitants auxquels je suis parent direct ou indirect furent nommés les "badins" car comme dans les pièces de Marivaux ...cela se mêlait fort  !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1870Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1870Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1870Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cela se mêlait fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cela [v|se mêlait|mêler|rs] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1870Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se mêlait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mêler" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1870Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1871"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1871Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1879" /><gams:textualContent>Il retire ses doigts, s'attirant ainsi une plainte sourde de l'homme sous lui qui se met de nouveau à le menacer tout bas , les yeux clos.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1871Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1871Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1871Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>à le menacer tout bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>à le [v|menacer|menacer|ts] tout [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1871Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>menacer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#menacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1871Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1872"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1872Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1880" /><gams:textualContent>Pendant que je menaçais tout bas le commandant, on m'appela depuis la maison.Izou posa la main sur mon épaule.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1872Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1872Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1872Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>je menaçais tout bas le commandant</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>je [v|menaçais|menacer|ts] tout [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] le commandant</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1872Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>menaçais</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#menacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1872Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1873"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1873Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1881" /><gams:textualContent>Alors que Klaus foudroyait du regard la petite Petrova, l'air de la menacer tout bas  qu'il allait la découper en tranches minces.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1873Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1873Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1873Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>l'air de la menacer tout bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>l'air de la [v|menacer|menacer|ts] tout [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1873Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>menacer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#menacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1873Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1874"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1874Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1882" /><gams:textualContent>J'ai du menacer ferme  pour qu'enfin ils acceptent de rembourser.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1874Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1874Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1874Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>J'ai du menacer ferme </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>J'ai du [v|menacer|menacer|is] [a|ferme|ferme|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1874Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>menacer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#menacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1874Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>ferme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ferme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1875"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1875Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1883" /><gams:textualContent>si tu as subi une ag ou pas, si tu as passé l'heure du repas ou pas (me souviens lors d'une légère intervention, rien à voir avec un accouchement, mais j'étais en chambre après le repas du soir ...j'ai du menacer ferme l'infirmière pour qu'elle aille me chercher de quoi manger un peu)</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1875Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1875Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1875Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>j'ai du menacer ferme l'infirmière</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>j'ai du [v|menacer|menacer|ts] [a|ferme|ferme|auvnqnnn] l'infirmière</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1875Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>menacer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#menacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1875Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>ferme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ferme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1876"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1876Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1884" /><gams:textualContent>Pour le homard malheureusement...les hommes sont bouchés.Si tu l'aimes encore alors n'hésite pas à menacer fort .Il n'a peut-être même pas pensé à cette issue, lui.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1876Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1876Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1876Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>n'hésite pas à menacer fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>n'hésite pas à [v|menacer|menacer|is] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1876Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>menacer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#menacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1876Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1885" /><gams:textualContent>Si Free veut protéger son code du firmware de la Freebox ils ont d'une part intérêt à être dissuasifs, d'autre part intérêt à frapper fort (ou menacer fort  ) en cas de « vol » de Freebox.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>à frapper fort (ou menacer fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>à [v|frapper|frapper|is] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] (ou [v|menacer|menacer|is] [a|fort|fort|auvntnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>frapper</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#frapper" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>menacer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#menacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1877Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1878"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1878Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1886" /><gams:textualContent>Mais elle n'avait pas l'air décidée à lui répondre.En effet, dans sa partie, les deux dés avaient fait un quadruple quinze, et cela menacait fort la Reine, surtout avec la Tour et le Fou en embuscade.Pis même si elle avait deux petites chevaux prêts à atteindre la ligne d'arrivée, c'était pas du tout cuit.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1878Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1878Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1878Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cela menacait fort la Reine</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cela [v|menacait|menacer|ts] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] la Reine</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1878Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>menacait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#menacer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1878Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1879"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1879Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1887" /><gams:textualContent>Alors j'aime beaucoup le principe du faerie stompy mais je n'ai que peu d'occasions de tester et une connaissance de magic limitée ce qui fait de moi un netdecker dans l'ame, en bref je viens mendier bien bas quelques conseils à cette comunauté compétente et rafinée</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1879Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1879Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1879Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>je viens mendier bien bas quelques conseils</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>je viens [v|mendier|mendier|ts] bien [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] quelques conseils</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1879Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mendier</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mendier" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1879Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1880"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1880Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1888" /><gams:textualContent>L’inconséquence politique peut nous mener plus bas  </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1880Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1880Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1880Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>L’inconséquence politique peut nous mener plus bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>L’inconséquence politique peut nous [v|mener|mener|ts] plus [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1880Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1880Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1881"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1881Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1889" /><gams:textualContent>Et la drogue peut vous mener bas ...Très bas  .Sky présentement devait avoir épuisé ou presque les consommations qu'il lui restait.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1881Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1881Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1881Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la drogue peut vous mener bas ...Très bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la drogue peut vous [v|mener|mener|ts] bas ...Très [a|bas|bas|auvmmrnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1881Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1881Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1882"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1882Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1890" /><gams:textualContent>En d’autres termes, le pouvoir a besoin d’une résistance mais qu’il peut maîtriser afin de la combattre et de la mener bas  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1882Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1882Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1882Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>de la mener bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>de la [v|mener|mener|ts] [a|bas|bas|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1882Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1882Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1883"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1883Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1891" /><gams:textualContent>Impayés trop nombreux, perte de marché, endettement ou baisse d’activité : de plus en plus de sociétés se trouvent confrontées à des difficultés pouvant les mener droit à la procédure collective.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1883Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1883Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1883Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>des difficultés pouvant les mener droit à la procédure</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>des difficultés pouvant les [v|mener|mener|ts] [a|droit|droit|auvnlnnn] à la procédure</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1883Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1883Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1884"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1884Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1892" /><gams:textualContent>Après une première évaluation de vos aptitudes physiques et techniques, un projet commun est adopté pour vous mener droit au but que vous vous êtes fixé.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1884Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1884Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1884Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>pour vous mener droit au but</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pour vous [v|mener|mener|ts] [a|droit|droit|auvnlnnn] au but</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1884Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1884Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1885"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1885Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1893" /><gams:textualContent>Lorsque le sel rentre en contact avec l’eau savonneuse, celui-ci se dissout, jusqu’à ce qu’un peu de sel atteigne la goutte d’alcool.Celle-ci va alors se déplacer le long du gradient de sel, ce qui va la mener droit sur la position de dépôt de la goutte de sel, où la concentration de sel est la plus importante.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1885Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1885Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1885Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ce qui va la mener droit sur la position</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ce qui va la [v|mener|mener|ts] [a|droit|droit|auvnlnnn] sur la position</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1885Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1885Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1886"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1886Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1894" /><gams:textualContent>Une course contre la montre qui pourrait bien la mener droite en enfer.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1886Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1886Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1886Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui pourrait bien la mener droite en enfer</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui pourrait bien la [v|mener|mener|ts] [a|droite|droit|aavnlnnn] en enfer</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1886Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1886Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droite</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1887"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1887Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1895" /><gams:textualContent>Peu de temps après les chiens semblent mener dur  , il y a des sangliers mais apparemment la trace est perdue, dans un premier temps puis retrouvée plus loin par U....e la petite Cairn Terrier du chef de traque mais trop tard le sanglier est sorti.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1887Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1887Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1887Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les chiens semblent mener dur </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les chiens semblent [v|mener|mener|is] [a|dur|dur|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1887Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1887Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>dur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1888"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1888Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1896" /><gams:textualContent>Je vous souhaite de ne pas y être.Sinon Rusard va vous mener dur  !!La pénitence sera de longue durée !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1888Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1888Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1888Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Sinon Rusard va vous mener dur </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Sinon Rusard va vous [v|mener|mener|ts] [a|dur|dur|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1888Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1888Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>dur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1889"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1889Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1897" /><gams:textualContent>Restez à l'écart de ces histoires, elles peuvent vous pourrir la vie et vous la mener dur  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1889Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1889Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1889Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elles peuvent vous pourrir la vie et vous la mener dur </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elles peuvent vous pourrir la vie et vous la [v|mener|mener|ts] [a|dur|dur|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1889Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1889Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>dur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1890"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1890Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1898" /><gams:textualContent>Faciliter la vie des usagers, mais la mener dure aux fraudeurs...C'est, en raccourci, la philosophie qu'affiche la CPAM (Caisse primaire d'assurance maladie) des Côtes-d'Armor.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1890Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1890Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1890Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Faciliter la vie des usagers, mais la mener dure aux fraudeurs</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Faciliter la vie des usagers, mais la [v|mener|mener|ts] [a|dure|dur|aionmnnn] aux fraudeurs</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1890Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1890Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>dure</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1891"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1891Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1899" /><gams:textualContent>Le skate est une discipline artistique et sportive qui peut mener haut  .A condition de savoir amortir sa chute.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1891Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1891Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1891Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui peut mener haut </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui peut [v|mener|mener|is] [a|haut|haut|auonlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1891Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1891Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1892"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1892Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1900" /><gams:textualContent>Ceux-ci se livreront une bataille acharnée qui devrait les mener haut dans la hiérarchie ; dès lors, gare aux Cédric De Cecco, Gino Bux, Polle Geusens, Stijn Pacolet (tous sur Peugeot 208), et autres Adrian Fernemont et Amaury Molle (Ford Fiesta).</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1892Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1892Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1892Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>une bataille acharnée qui devrait les mener haut dans la hiérarchie</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>une bataille acharnée qui devrait les [v|mener|mener|ts] [a|haut|haut|auonlnnn] dans la hiérarchie</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1892Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1892Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1893"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1893Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1901" /><gams:textualContent>Audrey Le Floch (Stade brestois) aborde quatre semaines charnières de sa saison hivernale de cross-country.Quatre semaines qui pourraient la mener haut, très haut  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1893Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1893Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1893Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui pourraient la mener haut, très haut </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui pourraient la [v|mener|mener|ts] haut, très [a|haut|haut|auomlrnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1893Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1893Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1894"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1894Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1902" /><gams:textualContent>Pourtant, malgré ce petit succès qui a mis les rieurs de son côté, il paraît ne pas en mener large  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1894Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1894Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1894Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>il paraît ne pas en mener large </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il paraît ne pas en [v|mener|mener|is] [a|large|large|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1894Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1894Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>large</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#large" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1895"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1895Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1903" /><gams:textualContent>Maryse Joissains ne doit pas en mener large ce soir, d'autant plus que la candidate frontiste se maintien...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1895Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1895Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1895Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Maryse Joissains ne doit pas en mener large ce soir</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Maryse Joissains ne doit pas en [v|mener|mener|is] [a|large|large|auvnmnnn] ce soir</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1895Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1895Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>large</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#large" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1896"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1896Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1904" /><gams:textualContent>Les entreprises sont également affectées dans leurs activités.Les caravanes rendent difficile l’accès pour les livraisons et le personnel dit ne pas en « mener large » à l’entrée et à la sortie du travail :</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1896Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1896Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1896Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le personnel dit ne pas en « mener large »</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le personnel dit ne pas en « [v|mener|mener|is] [a|large|large|auvnmnnn] »</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1896Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mener</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1896Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>large</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#large" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1897"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1897Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1905" /><gams:textualContent>Après quelques kilomètres, on atteint la Marina de Pevani, où se trouvent certaines villas avec des grands terrains directement sur la côte.Ca devient en fait intéressant à partir de maintenant, car la route fait un virage fort et mène raide en amont.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1897Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1897Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1897Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la route fait un virage fort et mène raide en amont</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la route fait un virage fort et [v|mène|mener|is] [a|raide|raide|auonmnnn] en amont</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1897Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mène</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1897Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>raide</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1898"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1898Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1906" /><gams:textualContent>Il n'a pas été frappé mais on l'a "mené raide ".On lui disait que c'était lui ou Gustave et que si Gustave était condamné il aurait droit "à la tête coupée ou à Cayenne".</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1898Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1898Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1898Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>on l'a \"mené raide </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>on [v|l'a \"mené|mener|ts] [a|raide|raide|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1898Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>l'a \"mené</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mener" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1898Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>raide</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1899"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1899Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1907" /><gams:textualContent>La bonne solution n'est pas forcément de crier sur tous les toits "ON NE PEUT PAS HYPNOTISER SANS CONSENTEMENT" alors qu'on sait pertinemment que c'est faux. Mentir  haut et fort en allant jusqu'à m'insulter afin d'être sûr que le grand public reste ignorant, le tout pour conserver votre clientèle, ce n'est pas très garant de l'éthique non plus.;) </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1899Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1899Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1899Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1899Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> Mentir  haut et fort en allant</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Mentir|mentir|is]  [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] en allant</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1899Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Mentir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mentir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1899Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1899Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1900"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1900Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1908" /><gams:textualContent>Ceci s’adresse à celles ou ceux qui auraient encore envie de vomir des horreurs, de mentir haut et fort  et de traîner des personnes qui n’ont rien à se reprocher, bien au contraire, dans un torrent de propos pestilentiels sortis tout droit du caniveau, lâches et d’une violence aveugle et inimaginable, mais les accusations gratuites ont un prix, maintenant il faut assumer et payer !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1900Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1900Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1900Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1900Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>de mentir haut et fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>de [v|mentir|mentir|is] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1900Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mentir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mentir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1900Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1900Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1901"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1901Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1909" /><gams:textualContent>Depuis plusieurs mois cette dérive ne semble pas émouvoir les pouvoirs publics beaucoup plus préoccupés par les élections que par les drames routiers.Ils laissent le champ libre aux opposants à la sécurité routière mentir haut et fort  y compris dans l’enceinte de la représentation nationale.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1901Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1901Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1901Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1901Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text> mentir haut et fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|mentir|mentir|is] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1901Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mentir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mentir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1901Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1901Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1902"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1902Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1910" /><gams:textualContent>Le Bordel étant, comme le faisait gentiment remarquer le maire Adelie en profita pour aller vers l'orgue et se mit à jouer du Ray Charles.Tandis que même le maire se mettait aise en chopant une bouteille de bière et une part de gâteau.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1902Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1902Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1902Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le maire se mettait aise en chopant</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le maire [v|se mettait|mettre|rs] [a|aise|aise|ausnmnnn] en chopant</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1902Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se mettait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1902Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>aise</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#aise" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1903"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1903Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1911" /><gams:textualContent>Vivre quelques siècles?Voilà qui était pour le moins prometteur.Julien entendit à peine les remarques que Random faisait quant à la relativité de cette longévité, tant l'information le mettait aise  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1903Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1903Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1903Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>l'information le mettait aise </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>l'information le [v|mettait|mettre|ts] [a|aise|aise|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1903Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1903Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>aise</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#aise" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1904"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1904Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1912" /><gams:textualContent>Accompagné de deux gardes émeraudes, ils ne se séparaient jamais de lui complètement, ni lui d'eux à vrai dire , ils se mirent aise  et d'aucuns pariaient sur le sexe de l'enfant à venir.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1904Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1904Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1904Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ils se mirent aise </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ils [v|se mirent|mettre|rs] [a|aise|aise|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1904Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se mirent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1904Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>aise</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#aise" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1905"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1905Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1913" /><gams:textualContent>Si votre chienne est sur le point de mettre bas  , restez calme !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1905Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1905Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1905Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>de mettre bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>de [v|mettre|mettre|is] [a|bas|bas|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1905Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1905Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1906"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1906Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1914" /><gams:textualContent>Ma drago femelle Orchidée/pourpre niveau 38 ne veut pas mettre bas  , même après que les 108 heures se soient écoulées (puisque elle est au stade 6, le tps de gestation est 108 heures -source- dans la rubrique "accouplement de dindes" ) </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1906Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1906Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1906Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ma drago femelle Orchidée\/pourpre niveau 38 ne veut pas mettre bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ma drago femelle Orchidée\/pourpre niveau 38 ne veut pas [v|mettre|mettre|is] [a|bas|bas|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1906Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1906Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1907"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1907Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1915" /><gams:textualContent>Je pensais au début mettre tout dans la force, et dans la constitution pour avoir plus de rounds de rage et laisser le reste à 10. Mais comme j'ai vu que pas mal de dons de combats nécessitaient une bonne dex, je me demande à présent si mon choix était bon.Sachant qu'il ne faudrait peut être pas non plus négliger la sagesse, je comptais la mettre bas au début (après tout, un barbare sage...hein, on s'est compris) mais j'ai vu après coup que c'était utile pour la perception.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1907Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1907Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1907Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>je comptais la mettre bas au début</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>je comptais la [v|mettre|mettre|ts] [a|bas|bas|auvnmnnn] au début</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1907Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1907Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1916" /><gams:textualContent>si tu veux juste rouler ce sera plus agréable de mettre ta selle haute mais si tu veux faire du trial tu as plutot interet a la mettre basse  comme ça normalement tu pourra sauter plus haut  </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tu as plutot interet a la mettre basse </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tu as plutot interet a la [v|mettre|mettre|ts] [a|basse|bas|aaonlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>basse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>tu pourra sauter plus haut </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tu pourra [v|sauter|sauter|is] plus [a|haut|haut|ausmlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>sauter</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#sauter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1908Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1909"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1909Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1917" /><gams:textualContent>je suis alle chez euromaster 2 fois de suite car mon volant apres avoir fait la geometrie n'etait pas droit.et il n'est toujours pas droit, il est un peu a gauche vraiment un peu en ligne droite (la voiture ne tire pas) Est ce que je peux le mettre droit  en devissant un peu la rotule de direction cote conducteur et en vissant celle passager </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1909Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1909Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1909Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>je peux le mettre droit </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>je peux le [v|mettre|mettre|ts] [a|droit|droit|auonlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1909Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1909Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1910"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1910Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1918" /><gams:textualContent>Si le phasme est en danger, ou poursuivi par un prédateur il peut allonger ses pattes le long de son thorax et se mettre droit  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1910Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1910Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1910Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>il peut allonger ses pattes le long de son thorax et se mettre droit </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il peut allonger ses pattes le long de son thorax et [v|se mettre|mettre|rs] [a|droit|droit|ausnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1910Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1910Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1911"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1911Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1919" /><gams:textualContent>Quand la jument est attelée, elle a tendance à marcher un peu comme une personne saoule, il faut toujours la mettre droit  ...aussi, elle secoue sa tête...ce qu'elle ne fait pas montée.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1911Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1911Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1911Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>il faut toujours la mettre droit </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il faut toujours la [v|mettre|mettre|ts] [a|droit|droit|auonlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1911Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1911Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1912"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1912Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1920" /><gams:textualContent>La façon la plus simple de reproduire la douleur, je suis assit sur ma chaise, et je déplis la jambe pour la mettre à 180 degrés (pour la mettre droite devant moi).</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1912Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1912Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1912Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>(pour la mettre droite devant moi</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>(pour la [v|mettre|mettre|ts] [a|droite|droit|aaonlnnn] devant moi</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1912Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1912Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droite</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1913"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1913Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1921" /><gams:textualContent> se mettre  haut sur ses pieds c'est complètement con, se baisser c'est du suicide ou comment n'importe quel coup de pied ou de genou arrivent au niveau de ton visage</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1913Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1913Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1913Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> se mettre  haut sur ses pieds</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|se mettre|mettre|rs]  [a|haut|haut|ausnlnnn] sur ses pieds</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1913Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1913Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1922" /><gams:textualContent>Les peuples fraternisent, les peuples ont le ventre et le coeur gros d’un monde meilleur.Proche est le terme.Les peuples ne vont pas mettre bas  , non, pas cette fois.Ils vont le mettre haut , ce monde nouveau-né. Très haut  , comme la barre à franchir, haut comme la marche à monter.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Les peuples ne vont pas mettre bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Les peuples ne vont pas [v|mettre|mettre|is] [a|bas|bas|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ils vont le mettre haut , ce monde nouveau-né. Très haut </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ils vont le [v|mettre|mettre|ts] haut , ce monde nouveau-né. Très [a|haut|haut|auvmmrnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1914Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1915"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1915Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1923" /><gams:textualContent>D'accord ; je pensais que tu parlais de la speedbar, j'avais mal lu ; Mais ça va être un peu complexe en CSS3 : Il faut d'abord la masquer de base et la mettre haut  , puis avec la propriété transitions au hover, la faire apparaître puis descendre...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1915Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1915Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1915Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Il faut d'abord la masquer de base et la mettre haut </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Il faut d'abord la masquer de base et la [v|mettre|mettre|ts] [a|haut|haut|auonlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1915Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1915Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1916"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1916Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1924" /><gams:textualContent>Le tuto de saviola59 et tres bien sauf que sa concerne les parties d échecs ou l on doit mettre mat l adversaire en un nombre de coups defini a l avance GT:GUYTS xbox360</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1916Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1916Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1916Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ou l on doit mettre mat l adversaire</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ou l on doit [v|mettre|mettre|ts] [a|mat|mat|auonmnnn] l adversaire</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1916Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1916Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>mat</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mat" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1917"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1917Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1925" /><gams:textualContent>A partir du diagramme 7 qui est la position de base, vous pouvez analyser comment mettre mat le roi adverse.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1917Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1917Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1917Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>comment mettre mat le roi</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>comment [v|mettre|mettre|ts] [a|mat|mat|auonmnnn] le roi</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1917Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1917Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>mat</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mat" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1918"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1918Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1926" /><gams:textualContent>Il est possible de mettre la jalousie en échec, mais bien peu arrivent à la mettre mat  .La plupart du temps ,elle est cantonnée à un autre niveau que le partage des corps (séparation sexe/sentiments) ou inhibée par une sorte de jeu à somme nulle (échangisme).</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1918Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1918Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1918Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>peu arrivent à la mettre mat </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>peu arrivent à la [v|mettre|mettre|ts] [a|mat|mat|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1918Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1918Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>mat</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mat" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1919"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1919Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC1927" /><gams:textualContent>Je vais essayer de mettre noir sur  blanc ce que je crois avoir compris à propos de ces histoires de dérivées et de différentielles.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1919Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1919Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1919Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1919Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:preposition rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1919Ph1Pe1" /><aaif:text>Je vais essayer de mettre noir sur  blanc ce que je crois</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Je vais essayer de [v|mettre|mettre|ts] [a|noir|noir|auvnmnnC] [p|sur|sur]  [a|blanc|blanc|auvnmnnC] ce que je crois</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1919Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>mettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#mettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1919Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>noir</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#noir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En1919Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>blanc</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#blanc" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Preposition rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.a