vrette, levrette &lt;lb/&gt; Prendre  profond dans un gros cul</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2563Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2563Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2563Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Prendre  profond dans un gros cul</aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Prendre|prendre|is]  [a|profond|profond|auvnlnnn] dans un gros cul</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2563Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Prendre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2563Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>profond</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#profond" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2564"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2564Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2575 " /><gams:textualContent>blonde prise profond par un chien - blonde poilue plein sperme </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2564Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2564Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2564Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>blonde prise profond par un chien</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>blonde [v|prise|prendre|ts] [a|profond|profond|auanlnnn] par un chien</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2564Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prise</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2564Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>profond</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#profond" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2565"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2565Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2576" /><gams:textualContent>Une mamie à gros seins se la prend profond  </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2565Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2565Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2565Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Une mamie à gros seins se la prend profond </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Une mamie à gros seins [v|se la prend|prendre|rs] [a|profond|profond|auvnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2565Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se la prend</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2565Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>profond</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#profond" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2566"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2566Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2577" /><gams:textualContent>Je t'aime comme une âme &lt;lb/&gt;Eternelle, telle une flamme &lt;lb/&gt;Vers mon cœur de cristal, &lt;lb/&gt;Pour toi qui me prend suave  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2566Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2566Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2566Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pour toi qui me prend suave </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pour toi qui me [v|prend|prendre|ts] [a|suave|suave|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2566Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prend</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2566Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>suave</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#suave" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2567"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2567Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2578" /><gams:textualContent>Il y a plusieurs possibilités : des cauchemars (ça arrive, et souvent par périodes), les prémolaires qui se préparent ( long et douloureux ), phase de peur de la séparation (les enfants vérifient souvent inconsciemment que maman est toujours là...même la nuit).</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2567Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2567Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2567Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2567Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>les prémolaires qui se préparent ( long et douloureux )</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les prémolaires qui [v|se préparent|préparer|rs] ( [a|long|long|auvntnnC] et [a|douloureux|douloureux|auvnmnnC] )</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2567Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se préparent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#préparer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2567Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>long</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#long" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2567Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>douloureux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#douloureux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2568"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2568Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2579" /><gams:textualContent>moi j'ai zéro intuition, je suis juste super curieuse et ça m'amuse de voir que ceratines arrivent à "pressentir" juste  !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2568Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2568Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2568Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ceratines arrivent à \"pressentir\" juste </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ceratines arrivent à [v|\"pressentir\"|pressentir|is] [a|juste|juste|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2568Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>\"pressentir\"</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pressentir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2568Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>juste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#juste" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2569"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2569Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2580" /><gams:textualContent>Il ne sait pas à quel point il pressent juste  : c’est un abîme qui va s’ouvrir, dans lequel va chuter un pan entier de l’économie mondiale, menant à leur perte les systèmes financiers, les grands groupes, les banques et les millions d’hommes et de femme qui en dépendent.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2569Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2569Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2569Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>il pressent juste </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il [v|pressent|pressentir|is] [a|juste|juste|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2569Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pressent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#pressentir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2569Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>juste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#juste" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2570"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2570Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2581" /><gams:textualContent>Après elles épurent cette pâte et la pressent fort entre leurs mains, et réservent, et recueillent cureusement dans des coys le suc qui en tombe[...] </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2570Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2570Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2570Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elles épurent cette pâte et la pressent fort entre leurs mains</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elles épurent cette pâte et la [v|pressent|presser|ts] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] entre leurs mains</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2570Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pressent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#presser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2570Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2571"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2571Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2582" /><gams:textualContent>Tu peux éventuellement présenter la chose en disant que l’air est une éponge avec des endroit plus ou moins humide et que les différentes conditions presse plus ou moins efficacement l’éponge : si l’éponge est pressée fort  et qu’il y a beaucoup d’eau : grosses précipitation, si l’éponge est pressée fort mais qu’il n’y a pas beaucoup d’eau : précipitations plus faibles et s’il y a beaucoup d’eau mais que l’éponge n’est pas pressée : il ne pleut pas.C’est peut-être un peu simpliste mais bon … </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2571Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2571Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2571Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>l’éponge est pressée fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>l’éponge [v|est pressée|presser|ts] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2571Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>est pressée</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#presser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2571Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2572"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2572Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2583" /><gams:textualContent>Ils appuient sans doute sur L1 ou R1, tiens sans la manette en mains je e me souviens plus qui te permet de presser fort  avec ton joueur et un second geré par L'IA </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2572Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2572Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2572Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui te permet de presser fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui te permet de [v|presser|presser|is] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2572Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>presser</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#presser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2572Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2573"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2573Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2584" /><gams:textualContent>Le système fonctionne bien, les latéraux sont hauts, les milieux et attaquants pressent forts  , sauf Messi dispensé.Di Maria a appris toute l'année à presser comme un mort de faim, il apporte mine de rien un peu de "muscle" en attaque, lui qui est encore plus flaco qu'El Flaco.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2573Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2573Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2573Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les milieux et attaquants pressent forts </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les milieux et attaquants [v|pressent|presser|is] [a|forts|fort|aivnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2573Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pressent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#presser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2573Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>forts</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2574"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2574Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2585" /><gams:textualContent>Demain il faudra attaquer dés le début du match et presser haut  afin de se créer un maximum d’occasions et de les concrétiser.Il ne faudra pas laisser d’espaces pour éviter les tentatives de contre.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2574Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2574Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2574Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>il faudra attaquer dés le début du match et presser haut </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il faudra attaquer dés le début du match et [v|presser|presser|is] [a|haut|haut|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2574Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>presser</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#presser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2574Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2575"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2575Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2586" /><gams:textualContent>Non mais arrête, comment tu veux le stopper avec l'accélération qu'il tape ?* Il part de 65m et 50m, les défenseurs pressent hauts  ils s'attendent pas à ce qu'il parte aussi vite ils peuvent rien faire.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2575Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2575Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2575Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les défenseurs pressent hauts </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les défenseurs [v|pressent|presser|is] [a|hauts|haut|aivnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2575Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pressent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#presser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2575Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>hauts</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2576"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2576Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2587" /><gams:textualContent>La fin du match est très tendue, l'Ukraine devant gagner pour passer, elles pressent hautes sur nos relances, nous empêchant de construire le jeu.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2576Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2576Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2576Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elles pressent hautes sur nos relances</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elles [v|pressent|presser|is] [a|hautes|haut|aavnqnnn] sur nos relances</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2576Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pressent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#presser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2576Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>hautes</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2577"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2577Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2588" /><gams:textualContent>Ils pressent haut  et montrent beaucoup plus de détermination que la selección et récupèrent les ballons assez haut.Sur un nouveau service de Blind, Robben fait parler son talent et sa grande forme du moment pour tromper Casillas d’une frappe légèrement détournée après avoir enrhumé Piqué d’un crochet du droit </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2577Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2577Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2577Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ils pressent haut </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ils [v|pressent|presser|is] [a|haut|haut|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2577Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pressent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#presser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2577Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2578"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2578Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2589" /><gams:textualContent>Les Manceaux ripostent, mais Planus veille.Les deux formations se pressent haut  .Trémoulinas, parfaitement servis par Gourcuff pousse un peu trop son ballon.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2578Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2578Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2578Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Les deux formations se pressent haut </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Les deux formations [v|se pressent|presser|rs] [a|haut|haut|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2578Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se pressent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#presser" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2578Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2590" /><gams:textualContent>Frère et sœur nous aurons beau prier fort , crier fort les noms de Dieu, les oeuvres temoigneront tjrs mieux la foi que l'emotion, ou les sacrifices.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>nous aurons beau prier fort , crier fort les noms</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>nous aurons beau [v|prier|prier|ts] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] , [v|crier|crier|ts] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] les noms</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prier</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prier" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>crier</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#crier" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2579Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2580"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2580Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2591" /><gams:textualContent>#entrainde  prier  fort  pour que mes bouteilles de vin protégées par deux culottes et un soutif n'explosent pas dans ma valise </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2580Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2580Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2580Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> prier  fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|prier|prier|is]  [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2580Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prier</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prier" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2580Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2581"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2581Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2592" /><gams:textualContent>Quand j'aurais cette confirmation je serai soulagée et bien contente de casser les gens qui prient forts  pour que j'ai un garçon.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2581Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2581Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2581Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les gens qui prient forts </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les gens qui [v|prient|prier|is] [a|forts|fort|aivnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2581Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prier" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2581Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>forts</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2582"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2582Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2593" /><gams:textualContent>Je suis chrétienne évangélique depuis 2006. Mais j’ai beaucoup de mal à prier haut et fort  , de proclamer de ma bouche.Je prie en silence dans mon for intérieur.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2582Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2582Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2582Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2582Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>j’ai beaucoup de mal à prier haut et fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>j’ai beaucoup de mal à [v|prier|prier|is] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2582Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prier</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prier" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2582Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2582Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2583"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2583Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2594" /><gams:textualContent>Les églises aussi sont agenouillées: La cathédrale, Sainte-Anne, Saint-Louis-Roi-de-France, Saint-Joseph.Quelques fidèles prient haut et fort  .Une prière en colère, d'autres le font à voix basse, dans leur cœur.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2583Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2583Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2583Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2583Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Quelques fidèles prient haut et fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Quelques fidèles [v|prient|prier|is] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2583Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prier" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2583Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2583Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2584"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2584Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2595" /><gams:textualContent>Je vous laisse découvrir.Ça me donne bien envie et encore une fois, cette nouvelle ère où l’être est enfin sorti de cette injonction capitaliste à produire gros  , grand et de manière ostentatoire est jubilante.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2584Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2584Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2584Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>l’être est enfin sorti de cette injonction capitaliste à produire gros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>l’être est enfin sorti de cette injonction capitaliste à [v|produire|produire|is] [a|gros|gros|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2584Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>produire</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#produire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2584Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2596" /><gams:textualContent>Désormais, il n’est plus nécessaire de produire gros : il faut produire bien et durable  !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>il n’est plus nécessaire de produire gros : il faut produire bien et durable </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il n’est plus nécessaire de [v|produire|produire|is] [a|gros|gros|auvnqnnn] : il faut [v|produire|produire|is] bien et [a|durable|durable|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>produire</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#produire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>produire</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#produire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2585Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>durable</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#durable" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2586"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2586Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2597" /><gams:textualContent>Je joue la Charr qui aime les pommes, une Sylvari couleur de miel, se disputer avec les Dolyaks, péter dans le bain, bricoler des machins qui lancent des trucs qui font des trous dans les gens.Si c'est magique c'est meilleur.La même Charr que vous entendrez proférer haut et fort "JE SUIS PAS UN CHATON !" tandis que sa truffe fera un mignon "nuf nuf nuf" qui achèvera de la décrédibiliser totalement (Non elle a pas de chance).</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2586Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2586Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2586Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2586Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>La même Charr que vous entendrez proférer haut et fort \"JE SUIS PAS UN CHATON</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>La même Charr que vous entendrez [v|proférer|proférer|ts] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] \"JE SUIS PAS UN CHATON</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2586Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>proférer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#proférer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2586Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2586Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2587"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2587Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2598" /><gams:textualContent>Le -G- Dire que les québécois ne sont pas des canadiens ...* pour oser proférer haut et fort une vérité si dérangeante , ton pseudo recevra le prix Albert Londres ...à titre posthume * </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2587Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2587Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2587Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2587Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>pour oser proférer haut et fort une vérité si dérangeante</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pour oser [v|proférer|proférer|ts] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] une vérité si dérangeante</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2587Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>proférer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#proférer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2587Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2587Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2588"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2588Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2599" /><gams:textualContent>Une nouvelle alliance est au pouvoir a Maurice.Elle a pris pour nom : l’Avenir, ce qui est une manière subtile et intelligente de nous le promettre beau et resplendissant  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2588Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2588Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2588Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2588Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>de nous le promettre beau et resplendissant </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>de nous le [v|promettre|promettre|ts] [a|beau|beau|auonmnnC] et [a|resplendissant|resplendissant|auonmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2588Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>promettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#promettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2588Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>beau</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2588Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>resplendissant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#resplendissant" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2589"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2589Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2600" /><gams:textualContent>Liste des joueurs inscrit pour le PRONO CHALLENGE WORLD CUP 2014 au brésil.Certains revanchard(e)s nous la promettent belle et disputée .Il y a encore possibilité d'y participer il suffit de mettre votre pseudo ci dessous dans la rubrique "commenter ou écrire un commentaire".</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2589Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2589Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2589Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2589Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Certains revanchard(e)s nous la promettent belle et disputée </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Certains revanchard(e)s nous la [v|promettent|promettre|ts] [a|belle|beau|aaonmnnC] et [a|disputée|disputé|aionmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2589Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>promettent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#promettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2589Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>belle</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2589Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>disputée</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#disputé" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2590"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2590Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2602" /><gams:textualContent>on a du lui promettre gros  pour qu'il renonce a tout ça ............</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2590Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2590Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2590Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>on a du lui promettre gros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>on a du lui [v|promettre|promettre|is] [a|gros|gros|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2590Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>promettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#promettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2590Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2591"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2591Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2603" /><gams:textualContent>J'ai pris du plaisir à y jouer et à le finir complètement, et c'était un peu long.Cependant ce n'est vraiment pas la bombe qui était annoncé avant sa sortie, il y a une impression générale de pas fini quoi.Cela dit, ça peut promettre gros  pour des éventuelles suites.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2591Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2591Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2591Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça peut promettre gros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça peut [v|promettre|promettre|is] [a|gros|gros|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2591Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>promettre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#promettre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2591Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2592"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2592Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2604" /><gams:textualContent>On a entendu à l’envi des responsables de hautes écoles déclarer que l’excellence était le seul critère de leurs choix et de leur stratégie.Mais en fait, que signifie ce terme ?Est-il magique au point qu’il suffirait de le prononcer haut et fort  pour que la formation que l’on offre soit meilleure que celle des concurrents ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2592Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2592Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2592Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2592Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>il suffirait de le prononcer haut et fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il suffirait de le [v|prononcer|prononcer|ts] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2592Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prononcer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prononcer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2592Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2592Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2593"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2593Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2605" /><gams:textualContent>Plus d’une centaine de personnalités connues de toutes les sphères de la société québécoise ont endossé une lettre adressée au premier ministre du Canada, aux ministres du gouvernement canadien et aux députés québécois au parlement canadien leur demandant de se prononcer haut et fort contre cette guerre, de la dénoncer publiquement et de refuser que le Canada y participe de quelque façon que ce soit, directe ou indirecte.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2593Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2593Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2593Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2593Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>demandant de se prononcer haut et fort contre cette guerre</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>demandant de [v|se prononcer|prononcer|rs] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] contre cette guerre</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2593Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>se prononcer</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prononcer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2593Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2593Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2594"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2594Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2606" /><gams:textualContent>Arrivée progressive des manifestants dès 13h15, début de la manifestation à partir de 13h35 le temps de s'installer, puis ensuite des discours expliquant les conditions d’élevage et dénonçant la façon dont l’animal est dépecer, ainsi que des slogans prononcés hauts et forts  ce sont enchainés durant 2h.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2594Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2594Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2594Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2594Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>des slogans prononcés hauts et forts </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>des slogans [v|prononcés|prononcer|ts] [a|hauts|haut|aianmnnC] et [a|forts|fort|aianmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2594Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>prononcés</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prononcer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2594Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>hauts</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2594Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>forts</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2595"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2595Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2607" /><gams:textualContent>Il y a 2 types de négociations, ceux qui proposent bas avec de la réserve derrière et ceux qui proposent cash le prix.Nous avons négociés notre maison de 10 000€ et nos vendeurs voulaient qu'on coupent la poire en 2 et pas question pour notre part c'était le maxi qu'on voulait mettre dans cette maison et c'était à prendre où à laisser.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2595Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2595Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2595Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ceux qui proposent bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ceux qui [v|proposent|proposer|is] [a|bas|bas|auonqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2595Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>proposent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#proposer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2595Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2596"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2596Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2608" /><gams:textualContent>Je veux pas fair el'oiseau de mauvaise augure, mais en gros si vous êytes plusieurs sur le poste, c pas les prétzentions qui vont valoir, mais le profil : si y sont intéressés par toi, y montent les enchères, ou alors ils te proposent bas pour marchander...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2596Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2596Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2596Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ils te proposent bas pour marchander</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ils te [v|proposent|proposer|is] [a|bas|bas|auonqnnn] pour marchander</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2596Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>proposent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#proposer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2596Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2597"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2597Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2609" /><gams:textualContent>Faire ces enfants ont un sentiment de solitude, l'ennui, l'envie facilement né pairs, l'anxiété, la dépression, la peur ou l'agression, le mensonge, pugnacité associée à l'expérience de la solitude, de vide, de dévalorisation.Faire enfants battus ont une tendance à la destruction et protestent bas la maîtrise de soi, la faiblesse, les intérêts cognitifs, le refus de travailler.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2597Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2597Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2597Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>enfants battus ont une tendance à la destruction et protestent bas la maîtrise de soi</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>enfants battus ont une tendance à la destruction et [v|protestent|protester|ts] [a|bas|bas|auvnqnnn] la maîtrise de soi</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2597Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>protestent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#protester" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2597Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2598"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2598Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2610" /><gams:textualContent>La Démocratie chrétienne (DC) protège le Vatican du Satan communiste-athée… De Naples à Palerme en passant par Reggio, cette même DC fréquente de drôles de paroissiens ?Regardons ailleurs, protestons bas  .Rien de ces terrestres turpitudes n’est éternel.Viendra bien un moment… De fait, depuis la décennie 1990, l’Église est plus vigoureusement anti-mafia : un Satan a chassé l’autre… </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2598Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2598Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2598Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Regardons ailleurs, protestons bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Regardons ailleurs, [v|protestons|protester|is] [a|bas|bas|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2598Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>protestons</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#protester" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2598Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2611" /><gams:textualContent>Minimiser ou chercher à diluer les méfaits de la tabagie sur l'organisme est juste incroyablement choquant *Il n'y a pas de bon ou mauvais tabac à fumer.Le tabac tue,  c'est prouvé , clair , net et précis .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599Ph1Ad3" /><aaif:text> c'est prouvé , clair , net et précis </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|c'est prouvé|prouver|ts] , [a|clair|clair|auvnmnnC] , [a|net|net|auvnmnnC] et [a|précis|précis|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>c'est prouvé</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#prouver" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clair</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#clair" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>net</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#net" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2599Ph1Ad3"><aaif:text>précis</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#précis" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2600"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2600Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2612" /><gams:textualContent>mille et mille bravos d'entreprendre ce travail; puisse t' il aboutir, je n'en doute pas et surtout puisse t'il être publié haut et fort !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2600Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2600Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2600Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2600Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>je n'en doute pas et surtout puisse t'il être publié haut et fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>je n'en doute pas et surtout puisse t'il être [v|publié|publier|ts] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|fort|fort|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2600Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>publié</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#publier" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2600Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2600Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2601"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2601Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2613" /><gams:textualContent>Dans un article daté du 9 juillet 2013, remis à jour (persiste et signe) le 11 juillet, Guylain Chevrier, chroniqueur sur Atlantico, mais aussi membre actif de la Mission laïcité du Haut Conseil à l’intégration, publie , haut et clair , -« oyez bonnes gens, et que tous s’en souviennent pour l’exemple »-, l’accusation suivante […]</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2601Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2601Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2601Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2601Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Guylain Chevrier, chroniqueur sur Atlantico, mais aussi membre actif de la Mission laïcité du Haut Conseil à l’intégration, publie , haut et clair , -« oyez bonnes gens</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Guylain Chevrier, chroniqueur sur Atlantico, mais aussi membre actif de la Mission laïcité du Haut Conseil à l’intégration, [v|publie|publier|ts] , [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnC] et [a|clair|clair|auvnmnnC] , -« oyez bonnes gens</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2601Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>publie</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#publier" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2601Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2601Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>clair</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#clair" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2602"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2602Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2614" /><gams:textualContent>Mais placez un amateur de fromages devant une belle miche de pain, un verre de cidre, et un bout de Maroilles.Et regardez-le saliver.Tout à coup, même si ça sent les pieds, ça sent bon.En fait, ça pue bon  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2602Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2602Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2602Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça pue bon </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|pue|puer|is] [a|bon|bon|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2602Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#puer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2602Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bon</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bon" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2603"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2603Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2615" /><gams:textualContent>C'est une très bonne fromagerie ou vous trouverez des fromages de toutes les régions de france qui puent bon  !L'accueil est agréable, rien a redire !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2603Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2603Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2603Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui puent bon </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui [v|puent|puer|is] [a|bon|bon|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2603Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>puent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#puer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2603Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bon</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bon" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2604"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2604Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2616" /><gams:textualContent>Les gens qui puent de la gueule.L'haleine animale pue fort  , mais étrangement ça me dérange pas plus que ça, alors que celles gens, putain non quoi, c'est insupportable et répugnant.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2604Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2604Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2604Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>L'haleine animale pue fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>L'haleine animale [v|pue|puer|is] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2604Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#puer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2604Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2605"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2605Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2617" /><gams:textualContent>Je pose la question car je me pose la question justement si c'est pas lié au faite que tu transpire dans la journée et donc ça pue fort les sécrétions.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2605Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2605Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2605Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça pue fort les sécrétions</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|pue|puer|is] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] les sécrétions</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2605Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#puer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2605Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2606"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2606Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2618" /><gams:textualContent>ok, je m'y mets dés demain (ben ouais, pas de chaussettes qui puent chez moi, mais je m'en vais en quérir demain dans les vestiaires de l'atelier mécanique....ça puent forts les pieds des chaumacs!) lol Pour le fromage, je pense plutôt au munster qui me parait être plus adapter à la situation très chère...ne pensez vous pas?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2606Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2606Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2606Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça puent forts les pieds</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|puent|puer|is] [a|forts|fort|aivnqnnn] les pieds</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2606Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>puent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#puer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2606Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>forts</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2607"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2607Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2619" /><gams:textualContent>Je sais que la solution de le quitter tout net  est un peu radicale..surtout que j'ai énormément de sentiments pour lui,je l'aime profondemment.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2607Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2607Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2607Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Je sais que la solution de le quitter tout net </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Je sais que la solution de le [v|quitter|quitter|ts] tout [a|net|net|auvmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2607Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>quitter</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#quitter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2607Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>net</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#net" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2608"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2608Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2620" /><gams:textualContent>Pour ma part, j'ai vu un pseudo dans le jeu qui m'a fait quitter net la vidéo.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2608Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2608Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2608Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui m'a fait quitter net la vidéo</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui m'a fait [v|quitter|quitter|ts] [a|net|net|auvnmnnn] la vidéo</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2608Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>quitter</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#quitter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2608Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>net</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#net" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2609"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2609Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2621" /><gams:textualContent>Quelle est la meilleure excuse pour terminer une relation amicale ou amoureuse ?&lt;lb/&gt;Il n'y a pas de meilleure excuse il faut la quitter net tout simplement .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2609Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2609Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2609Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>il faut la quitter net tout simplement</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il faut la [v|quitter|quitter|ts] [a|net|net|auvnmnnn] tout simplement</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2609Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>quitter</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#quitter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2609Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>net</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#net" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2610"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2610Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2622" /><gams:textualContent>Au bout d'un moment je ne fais plus de cadeaux, c'était ça ou Polichombr quittait nette la compet' (même s'il va quand même la quitter aux barrages)</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2610Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2610Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2610Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>c'était ça ou Polichombr quittait nette la compet</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>c'était ça ou Polichombr [v|quittait|quitter|ts] [a|nette|net|aavnmnnn] la compet</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2610Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>quittait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#quitter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2610Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>nette</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#net" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2611"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2611Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2623" /><gams:textualContent>Il me semble que quitter une partie, c'est comme une défaite.Mais au moins ça permet à Kévin d'aller rager tout rouge et tout triste  la tête dans son oreiller.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2611Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2611Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2611Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2611Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>ça permet à Kévin d'aller rager tout rouge et tout triste </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça permet à Kévin d'aller [v|rager|rager|is] tout [a|rouge|rouge|ausmmnnC] et tout [a|triste|triste|ausmmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2611Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rager</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rager" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2611Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rouge</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rouge" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2611Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>triste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#triste" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2612"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2612Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2624" /><gams:textualContent>Ça me fait bien marrer cet argument.D'autant plus quand ça fait rager tout rouge le p'tit grems...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2612Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2612Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2612Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça fait rager tout rouge le p'tit grems</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça fait [v|rager|rager|is] tout [a|rouge|rouge|ausmmnnn] le p'tit grems</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2612Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rager</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rager" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2612Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rouge</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rouge" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2613"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2613Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2625" /><gams:textualContent>Ce sont les gens comme vous qui me font rager tout rouge  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2613Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2613Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2613Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ce sont les gens comme vous qui me font rager tout rouge </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ce sont les gens comme vous qui me font [v|rager|rager|is] tout [a|rouge|rouge|auommnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2613Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>rager</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rager" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2613Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rouge</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rouge" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2614"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2614Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2626" /><gams:textualContent>La meilleure façon en la matière, c’est de raisonner très bas comme lui.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2614Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2614Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2614Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>c’est de raisonner très bas comme lui</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>c’est de [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] très [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] comme lui</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2614Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2614Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2615"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2615Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2627" /><gams:textualContent>tant qu'à raisonner bas  : si tu fais l'électricité par des mecs qui pédalent, n'y'a plus de pauvres et pas assez de chômeurs ...sur la planète entière ou plus bas encore : tu pédales pour fabriquer ton énergie et quand tu descend du vélo, t'es tellement crevé que t'as pas besoin du premier watt</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2615Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2615Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2615Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tant qu'à raisonner bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tant qu'à [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|bas|bas|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2615Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2615Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2616"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2616Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2628" /><gams:textualContent>Je n'ai jamais rien pris pour ça et suis plutôt du genre à aller voir un médecin tous les deux ans, et à rechigner sur les médocs à avaler...mais bon là je sentais qu'il était essentiel de rester à peu près en forme pour raisonner clair  , ne pas sombrer...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2616Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2616Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2616Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>il était essentiel de rester à peu près en forme pour raisonner clair </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il était essentiel de rester à peu près en forme pour [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|clair|clair|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2616Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2616Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clair</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#clair" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2617"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2617Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2629" /><gams:textualContent>Une fois de plus le flic qui a forcément des difficultés à raisonner clair  dans ces cas-là</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2617Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2617Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2617Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>des difficultés à raisonner clair </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>des difficultés à [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|clair|clair|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2617Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2617Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clair</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#clair" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2618"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2618Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2630" /><gams:textualContent>C’est méconnaître une femme tout en nuances, résolue, certes, mais psychologue avisée, nullement insensible et prompte à dégainer un humour juvénile.Elle séduit quiconque lui est présenté, pige au quart de tour et raisonne clair et net  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2618Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2618Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2618Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2618Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Elle séduit quiconque lui est présenté, pige au quart de tour et raisonne clair et net </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Elle séduit quiconque lui est présenté, pige au quart de tour et [v|raisonne|raisonner|is] [a|clair|clair|auvnmnnC] et [a|net|net|auvnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2618Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonne</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2618Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clair</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#clair" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2618Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>net</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#net" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2619"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2619Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2631" /><gams:textualContent>Le chef de file de Nancy 2014 intrigue.Certains ne voient en lui qu'un adepte du marketing de la différence qui parle bien mais raisonne creux  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2619Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2619Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2619Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui parle bien mais raisonne creux </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui parle bien mais [v|raisonne|raisonner|is] [a|creux|creux|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2619Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonne</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2619Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>creux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#creux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2620"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2620Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2632" /><gams:textualContent>Comme d’hab tu pinailles sur la forme mais dans le fond ça raisonne creux  .Je précise que tu es ni drôle ni intéressant.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2620Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2620Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2620Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça raisonne creux </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|raisonne|raisonner|is] [a|creux|creux|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2620Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonne</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2620Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>creux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#creux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2621"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2621Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2633" /><gams:textualContent>"Revolution "dans un verre d'eau, du déjà entendu, cela résonne et raisonne creux  ., d'autant plus que le verre est en cristal élyséen et que l'eau est croupie.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2621Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2621Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2621Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2621Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>cela résonne et raisonne creux </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>cela [v|résonne|résonner|is] et [v|raisonne|raisonner|is] [a|creux|creux|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2621Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>résonne</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#résonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2621Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>raisonne</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2621Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>creux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#creux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2634" /><gams:textualContent>La logique, c'est l'art de raisonner droit , la casuistique celui de raisonner courbe  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>c'est l'art de raisonner droit , la casuistique celui de raisonner courbe </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>c'est l'art de [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|droit|droit|auvnmnnn] , la casuistique celui de [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|courbe|courbe|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2622Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>courbe</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#courbe" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2635" /><gams:textualContent>La communication politique est une maladie de l’esprit : elle se veut d’ailleurs une perversion de la logique et un gauchissement du vocabulaire, mais le malheur de ceux qui l’emploient est de s’imaginer qu’ils en restent les maîtres et qu’ils peuvent à leur guise raisonner droit et parler juste  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>ils peuvent à leur guise raisonner droit et parler juste </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ils peuvent à leur guise [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|droit|droit|auvnmnnn] et [v|parler|parler|ts] [a|juste|juste|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>parler</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#parler" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2623Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>juste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#juste" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2624"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2624Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2636" /><gams:textualContent>où se cachent toutes les formes de tromperies qui nous empêchent de raisonner droit  ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2624Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2624Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2624Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui nous empêchent de raisonner droit </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui nous empêchent de [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|droit|droit|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2624Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2624Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2625"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2625Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2637" /><gams:textualContent>On peut raisonner faux  et aboutir à une conclusion juste.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2625Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2625Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2625Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>On peut raisonner faux </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>On peut [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|faux|faux|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2625Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2625Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>faux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#faux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2638" /><gams:textualContent>c’est comme en 4ième avec la géométrie plane : vaut mieux raisonner juste sur une figure fausse, que raisonner faux sur une figure juste…</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>vaut mieux raisonner juste sur une figure fausse, que raisonner faux sur une figure juste</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>vaut mieux [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|juste|juste|auvnmnnn] sur une figure fausse, que [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|faux|faux|auvnmnnn] sur une figure juste</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>juste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#juste" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2626Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>faux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#faux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2627"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2627Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2639" /><gams:textualContent>Maintenant ce que je me demande c'est est ce que ce ne serais pas ta philosophie qui raisonne fausse  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2627Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2627Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2627Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ta philosophie qui raisonne fausse </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ta philosophie qui [v|raisonne|raisonner|is] [a|fausse|faux|aavnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2627Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonne</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2627Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fausse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#faux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2628"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2628Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2640" /><gams:textualContent>Je vous présente ici des manières de ne pas raisonner juste  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2628Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2628Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2628Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>des manières de ne pas raisonner juste </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>des manières de ne pas [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|juste|juste|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2628Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2628Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>juste</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#juste" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2629"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2629Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2641" /><gams:textualContent>Parce que contrairement à vous et à eux je ne suis pas dogmatique.Je ne m'intéresse pas à d'où ils parlent mais au contenu de ce qu'ils disent.Quand ils raisonnent justes  , je leur en fait crédit, tout comme à vous d'ailleurs.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2629Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2629Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2629Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ils raisonnent justes </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ils [v|raisonnent|raisonner|is] [a|justes|juste|aivnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2629Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonnent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2629Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>justes</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#juste" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2630"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2630Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2642" /><gams:textualContent>Non, ce genre d'exercice n'est pas trop facile pour moi : la preuve : je sèche.Pourtant, essayons de raisonner serré  : Pour agir sur les chiffres, il faut nécessairement DEUX allumettes : soit pour déplace un 1, soit pour transformer un V en X, ou inversement.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2630Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2630Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2630Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>essayons de raisonner serré </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>essayons de [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|serré|serré|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2630Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2630Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>serré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serré" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2631"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2631Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2643" /><gams:textualContent>Vous aurez beau répondre argument pour argument, raisonner serré  , faire remarquer que la "science" n’est jamais qu'une chose contingeante suceptible de déchirantes révisions (v.la théorie des plaques tectoniques, de la mécanique quantique ou même de la cosmologie la plus récente).</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2631Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2631Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2631Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Vous aurez beau répondre argument pour argument, raisonner serré </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Vous aurez beau répondre argument pour argument, [v|raisonner|raisonner|is] [a|serré|serré|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2631Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonner</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2631Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>serré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serré" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2632"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2632Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2644" /><gams:textualContent>Chacun des adversaires apporte de puissants motifs en sa faveur; chacun raisonne serré  ; chacun expérimente.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2632Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2632Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2632Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>chacun raisonne serré </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>chacun [v|raisonne|raisonner|is] [a|serré|serré|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2632Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>raisonne</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raisonner" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2632Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>serré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serré" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2645" /><gams:textualContent>Banque Publique.Ca doit flatter haut et ramper bas autour de Moscovici et Montebourg pour se faire arroser avec votre argent.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Ca doit flatter haut et ramper bas autour de Moscovici</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ca doit [v|flatter|flatter|is] [a|haut|haut|auvnmnnn] et [v|ramper|ramper|is] [a|bas|bas|ausnlnnn] autour de Moscovici</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>flatter</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#flatter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>ramper</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ramper" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2633Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2634"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2634Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2646" /><gams:textualContent>Quand on en est rendu à travailler bénévolement pour une multinationale dont les cadres empochent des millions, c'est qu'on est vraiment pris pour ramper bas afin d'obtenir ce qu'on appelle encore un emploi.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2634Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2634Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2634Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>on est vraiment pris pour ramper bas afin d'obtenir</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>on est vraiment pris pour [v|ramper|ramper|is] [a|bas|bas|ausnlnnn] afin d'obtenir</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2634Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>ramper</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ramper" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2634Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2635"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2635Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC2647" /><gams:textualContent>Pour devenir cachère, Marine Le Pen devra ramper encore plus bas  </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2635Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2635Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2635Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Marine Le Pen devra ramper encore plus bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Marine Le Pen [v|devra ramper|ramper|is] encore plus [a|bas|bas|ausmlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2635Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>devra ramper</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ramper" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En2635Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:co