resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3728Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3746" /><gams:textualContent>Si tu veux les meilleurs de ma classe (grand lycée parisien) avec une bonne dizaine de bi-20 chaque année, ont fait entre 20 questions de niveau moyen et 2-3 questions qui valent gros  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3728Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3728Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3728Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>2-3 questions qui valent gros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>2-3 questions qui [v|valent|valoir|is] [a|gros|gros|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3728Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valoir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3728Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3729"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3729Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3747" /><gams:textualContent>A Antoing, on ne déguste pas la galette des rois comme partout ailleurs.Pour la cinquième année consécutive, l'asbl Jardins Bios du Hainaut a déposé des fèves un peu particulières dans les pâtisseries.Certaines d'entre elles valent gros  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3729Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3729Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3729Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elles valent gros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elles [v|valent|valoir|is] [a|gros|gros|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3729Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>valent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#valoir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3729Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3748" /><gams:textualContent>si le marché de renouvellement peut fonctionner durablement sur un mode inflationniste (qui vend cher peut racheter cher  ), il en va tout autrement du marché des primo-accédants, ces ménages qui n'ont pour seul viatique qu'une épargne alimentée par leurs revenus professionnels...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>qui vend cher peut racheter cher </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui [v|vend|vendre|is] [a|cher|cher|auonmnnn] peut [v|racheter|racheter|is] [a|cher|cher|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vend</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>racheter</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#racheter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cher</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3730Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>cher</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3731"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3731Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3749" /><gams:textualContent>Mais une vente réussie à ses salariés se prépare souvent sur plusieurs années, « avec les salariés et un second qui monte en compétences, note Bernard Penhoët.Le dirigeant a envie de la vendre cher  mais aussi de la vendre bien.Psychologiquement, il ne peut pas se dire que son entreprise ne va pas continuer.»</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3731Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3731Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3731Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Le dirigeant a envie de la vendre cher </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Le dirigeant a envie de la [v|vendre|vendre|ts] [a|cher|cher|auonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3731Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3731Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cher</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3750" /><gams:textualContent>Comme je l’ai relevé ici à plusieurs reprises et dans un rapport publié par le ministère de l’environnement, il est incohérent et coûteux de produire de l’électricité à partir de la chaleur d’incinération, vendue cher à EDF, alors qu’à quelques kilomètres un réseau de chaleur est chauffé au gaz.Cette chaleur venant de la combustion de gaz, ne coûte pas cher car l’électricité produite en même temps (en « cogénération ») est vendue très cher à EDF.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>l’électricité à partir de la chaleur d’incinération, vendue cher à EDF</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>l’électricité à partir de la chaleur d’incinération, [v|vendue|vendre|ts] [a|cher|cher|auanmnnn] à EDF</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cher</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>l’électricité produite en même temps (en « cogénération ») est vendue très cher à EDF</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>l’électricité produite en même temps (en « cogénération ») [v|est vendue|vendre|ts] très [a|cher|cher|ausmmnnn] à EDF</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>est vendue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3732Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>cher</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3733"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3733Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3751" /><gams:textualContent>Je sais que je pourrais pas la vendre chère  mais j'aimerais savoir combien je pourrais en tirer ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3733Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3733Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3733Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>je pourrais pas la vendre chère </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>je pourrais pas la [v|vendre|vendre|ts] [a|chère|cher|aaonmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3733Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3733Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>chère</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#cher" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#VerbObject" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3734"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3734Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3752" /><gams:textualContent>les joints de caches soupapes ont été changé quand j'ai acheté le véhicule et du coup ne pissait pas l'huile et tu m'as dis toi-même qu'elle pissait l'huile et que tu ne savais pas d'où ça venait.Alors de là à dire que je suis malhonnête je trouve vraiment gonflé.Car si j'aurais su que tu allais la vendre droit derrière je ne te l'aurais pas vendue à la somme qui a été fixée entre nous.Qui était, soit dit en passant, plus que correcte.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3734Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3734Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3734Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tu allais la vendre droit derrière</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tu allais la [v|vendre|vendre|ts] [a|droit|droit|auvntnnn] derrière</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3734Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3734Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3735"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3735Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3753" /><gams:textualContent>La pièce correspondant à la flèche jaune est elle bien la MB51 ?Est t'elle vendue droite  et doit être pliée ensuite?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3735Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3735Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3735Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Est t'elle vendue droite </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Est t'elle [v|vendue|vendre|ts] [a|droite|droit|aasnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3735Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3735Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droite</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3736"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3736Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3754" /><gams:textualContent>voici une photo, vu le problàme de pompe à essence la tige ne devrait elle pas être droite???je pose la question vu qu'elle est vendue droite </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3736Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3736Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3736Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle est vendue droite </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|est vendue|vendre|ts] [a|droite|droit|aasnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3736Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>est vendue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3736Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droite</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3737"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3737Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3755" /><gams:textualContent>On ne traite ces primes à la baisse que dans la spéculation sur les marchandises; dans la spéculation sur les valeurs, on obtient une prime à la baisse en vendant ferme  et en achetant simultanément à prime.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3737Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3737Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3737Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>on obtient une prime à la baisse en vendant ferme </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>on obtient une prime à la baisse en [v|vendant|vendre|is] [a|ferme|ferme|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3737Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3737Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>ferme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ferme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3738"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3738Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3756" /><gams:textualContent>En vertu de l’article 18.1 des statuts du SEBC, les banques centrales nationales des États membres dont la monnaie est l’euro (ci-après les "BCN de la zone euro") et la Banque centrale européenne (BCE) (ci-après conjointement dénommées les "banques centrales de l’Eurosystème") peuvent intervenir sur les marchés de capitaux, notamment en achetant et en vendant ferme des titres négociables.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3738Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3738Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3738Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>en vendant ferme des titres négociables</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>en [v|vendant|vendre|ts] [a|ferme|ferme|auvnmnnn] des titres négociables</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3738Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3738Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>ferme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ferme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3739"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3739Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3757" /><gams:textualContent>Ils lui vendent ferme 20% de leurs titres SFFAW au prix unitaire de 250F soit 32 millions de francs payables dans sept ans.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3739Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3739Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3739Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ils lui vendent ferme 20% de leurs titres</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ils lui [v|vendent|vendre|ts] [a|ferme|ferme|auvnmnnn] 20% de leurs titres</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3739Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vendent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vendre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3739Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>ferme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#ferme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3740"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3740Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3758" /><gams:textualContent>J'en avais des minuscules et des vilaines, je les ai alors mises sur mon compost et elles ont repoussées :D ...bon sont pas venues belles comme dans la terre, car il y avait des limaces aussi ^^!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3740Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3740Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3740Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elles ont repoussées :D ...bon sont pas venues belles comme dans la terre</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elles ont repoussées :D ...bon sont pas [v|venues|venir|is] [a|belles|beau|aasnmnnn] comme dans la terre</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3740Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venues</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3740Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>belles</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3741"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3741Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3759" /><gams:textualContent>Ca vient bon  (comme on dit joliment par chez nous) </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3741Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3741Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3741Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ca vient bon </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ca [v|vient|venir|is] [a|bon|bon|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3741Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3741Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bon</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bon" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3742"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3742Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3760" /><gams:textualContent> ça vient bon  on va pouvoir acceuillir les machines bientôt!!!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3742Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3742Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3742Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça vient bon </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|vient|venir|is] [a|bon|bon|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3742Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3742Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bon</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bon" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3743"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3743Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3761" /><gams:textualContent>quand j'en ai je met du chemi clean et pouf....tout disparait,l'eau vient clair comme du cristal......</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3743Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3743Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3743Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>l'eau vient clair comme du cristal</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>l'eau [v|vient|venir|is] [a|clair|clair|ausnmnnn] comme du cristal</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3743Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3743Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clair</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#clair" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3744"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3744Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3762" /><gams:textualContent>Mais avec ma recette, mes fenêtres viennent claires  à un point tel, qu’on croit qu’il n’y a pas de vitre.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3744Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3744Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3744Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>mes fenêtres viennent claires </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>mes fenêtres [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|claires|clair|aisnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3744Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3744Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>claires</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#clair" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3745"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3745Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3763" /><gams:textualContent>certes,le son vient clair , mais sans dynamique, et avec des aigus en moins...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3745Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3745Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3745Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le son vient clair , mais sans dynamique</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le son [v|vient|venir|is] [a|clair|clair|ausnmnnC] , mais sans dynamique</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3745Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3745Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clair</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#clair" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3746"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3746Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3764" /><gams:textualContent>ça vient clair  de l'utilisation des VST.j'utilise plusieur OZONE izotop sur differentes track...donc effectivement je jongle avec le bufferring asio de ma carte son...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3746Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3746Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3746Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça vient clair </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|vient|venir|is] [a|clair|clair|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3746Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3746Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>clair</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#clair" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3747"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3747Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3765" /><gams:textualContent>Si tu passes par Vallorbe et que tu vois que ça vient court  , tu peux faire un crochet au SuC de Lully, mais avec la descente que tu vas faire, tu vas bien recharger et je pense que ça devrait le faire.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3747Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3747Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3747Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça vient court </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|vient|venir|is] [a|court|court|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3747Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3747Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>court</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#court" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3748"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3748Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3766" /><gams:textualContent>Alors à la détente pour la club 4, poney était chaud haha :D Donc on part sur le tour, dès le départ il a prit de la vitesse, et je l'ai laissé faire.Il s'est appliqué tout le tour, à fait de gros efforts quand ça venait court  ..Il était toooop !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3748Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3748Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3748Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça venait court </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|venait|venir|is] [a|court|court|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3748Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3748Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>court</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#court" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3749"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3749Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3767" /><gams:textualContent>Sur l'autre pignon du 29, une composition à deux mains, deux signatures, Seth, Kislow, un arbre totem, deux gamines, chacune assise sur une couronne, d'arbre, en champignon, un gamin assis à son pied, ils sont de dos, le visage sur le totem est de trois-quarts, sur un paysage désertique, nuées vers l'horizon, ou depuis l'horizon elle vient court , au ras du sol des troncs cou coupé.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3749Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3749Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3749Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle vient court </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|vient|venir|is] [a|court|court|auvntnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3749Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3749Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>court</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#court" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3768" /><gams:textualContent>le problème c'est qu'il faut vraiment pouvoir juger rapidement si la balle vient courte ou longue , car si elle vient longue , c'est complètement autre chose qu'il faut faire, et c'est dur de se rattraper si on a anticipé.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>la balle vient courte ou longue </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la balle [v|vient|venir|is] [a|courte|court|aavnlnnC] ou [a|longue|long|aavnlnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>courte</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#court" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>longue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#long" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle vient longue </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|vient|venir|is] [a|longue|long|aavnlnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3750Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>longue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#long" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3751"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3751Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3769" /><gams:textualContent>Quelqu'un qui venait droit jusqu'à lui et se frottait contre ses robustes pattes antérieures, qui se dressait pour lécher ses oreilles soyeuses, dont le petit museau rose touchait sa truffe brune.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3751Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3751Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3751Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Quelqu'un qui venait droit jusqu'à lui</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Quelqu'un qui [v|venait|venir|is] [a|droit|droit|auvnlnnn] jusqu'à lui</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3751Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3751Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3752"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3752Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3770" /><gams:textualContent>De plus, la parlementaire élue pour l’Europe du nord venait droit de la section de Londres.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3752Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3752Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3752Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la parlementaire élue pour l’Europe du nord venait droit de la section</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la parlementaire élue pour l’Europe du nord [v|venait|venir|is] [a|droit|droit|auvnlnnn] de la section</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3752Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3752Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3753"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3753Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3771" /><gams:textualContent>Une grosse tempete qui venait droit sur moi</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3753Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3753Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3753Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Une grosse tempete qui venait droit sur moi</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Une grosse tempete qui [v|venait|venir|is] [a|droit|droit|auvnlnnn] sur moi</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3753Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3753Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3754"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3754Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3772" /><gams:textualContent>et depuis le dernier concours elle va bien!!j'ai resauté 3-4 fois en entrainement elle n'a jamais été aussi bien, elle vient droite sur l'obstacle en impulsion, elle ne fait plus sans cesse gauche droite comme avant, moi j'ai moins peur donc j'ose plus aussi bref pour le moment c'est le pied je prends enfin vraiment du plaisir à sauter avec et les progrès qu'on a fait c'est une grande fierté car on les a fait ensemble!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3754Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3754Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3754Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle vient droite sur l'obstacle</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|vient|venir|is] [a|droite|droit|aavnlnnn] sur l'obstacle</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3754Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3754Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droite</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3773" /><gams:textualContent>Lorsque j'ai préparé la recette, je crois que je n'ai pas mélangé suffisamment de jus de cuisson au mélange vinaigre et sirop d'érable puisque ça vraiment commencer à tourner plus que siropeux...ça s'en venait même dur ...j'ai donc ajouté de l'eau et continué de brasser et ce fût correct.Selon toi, Lèchevitrine, le fait que mon mélange s'en venait dur  , est-ce que c'était du à mon manque de jus de cuisson ou liquide?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça s'en venait même dur </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|s'en venait|venir|rs] même [a|dur|dur|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s'en venait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>dur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>mon mélange s'en venait dur </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>mon mélange [v|s'en venait|venir|rs] [a|dur|dur|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>s'en venait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3755Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>dur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3756"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3756Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3774" /><gams:textualContent>Je savais pas que quand la bédaine venait dur dur  , meme si tavais pas de douleurs c'tait des contractions...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3756Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3756Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3756Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la bédaine venait dur dur </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la bédaine [v|venait|venir|is] dur [a|dur|dur|ausnmrnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3756Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3756Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>dur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3757"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3757Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3775" /><gams:textualContent>même si je suis à 12 semaines et demi, je sentais des flatte flatte dans la bedaine le soir, et elle venait dure  comme à Xavier au début</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3757Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3757Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3757Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle venait dure </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|venait|venir|is] [a|dure|dur|aisnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3757Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3757Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>dure</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3758"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3758Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3776" /><gams:textualContent>La nouvelle collection Benibla, elle vient grave  de Paris Nord !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3758Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3758Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3758Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle vient grave </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|vient|venir|is] [a|grave|grave|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3758Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3758Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>grave</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#grave" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3759"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3759Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3777" /><gams:textualContent>Ce matin, Stéphane Soumier, présentateur de Good Morning Business sur BFM Business, a dans une série de tweets commenté ce qu'il appelle la "première crise du soviétisme de marché" et publié un article il y a quelques minutes sur "Les marchés contre Poutine" (le Captain' vient grave  de se faire griller sur ce coup !).</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3759Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3759Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3759Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le Captain' vient grave </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le Captain' [v|vient|venir|is] [a|grave|grave|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3759Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3759Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>grave</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#grave" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3778" /><gams:textualContent>Enfin voila ...ca pique grave  ...depuis le 1er janvier, j'ai l'impression que quand j'ouvre des tables, c'est pour donner mon argent ...bon ils viennent grave le chercher mais bon ...c'est abusé quand c'est long comme ca ...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ca pique grave </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ca [v|pique|piquer|is] [a|grave|grave|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>pique</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#piquer" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>grave</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#grave" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>ils viennent grave le chercher</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ils [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|grave|grave|auvnqnnn] le chercher</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3760Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>grave</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#grave" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3761"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3761Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3779" /><gams:textualContent>"C'était un musicien extraordinaire, entouré de gens excellents.J'ai grandi avec lui, il m'a fasciné depuis que j'étais petite", dit-elle, alors que des voisins vont et viennent , graves et sans un mot.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3761Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3761Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3761Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3761Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>des voisins vont et viennent , graves et sans un mot</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>des voisins [v|vont|aller|is] et [v|viennent|venir|is] , [a|graves|grave|aisnmnnC] et sans un mot</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3761Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vont</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#aller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3761Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3761Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>graves</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#grave" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3762"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3762Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3780" /><gams:textualContent>j'oublié, si tu veux que les bulbes viennent gros  , en plus te ton engrais il te faut dans ton substrat de l'osmocote</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3762Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3762Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3762Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les bulbes viennent gros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les bulbes [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|gros|gros|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3762Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3762Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3763"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3763Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3781" /><gams:textualContent>Il me reste cependant à les changer de pot (si je veux qu'ils viennent gros  ).J'ai hâte de voir comment ils seront en fin de saison.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3763Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3763Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3763Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ils viennent gros </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ils [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|gros|gros|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3763Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3763Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3764"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3764Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3782" /><gams:textualContent>Il trouve aussi que la scène du baiser venait gros comme une maison.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3764Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3764Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3764Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la scène du baiser venait gros comme une maison</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la scène du baiser [v|venait|venir|is] [a|gros|gros|ausnmnnn] comme une maison</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3764Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3764Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>gros</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3765"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3765Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3783" /><gams:textualContent>La saison des festivals, fêtes, fiestas, férias est terminée.Enfin!« Si tu ne viens pas à la fête, la fête viendra à toi » disait Philippe Muray.Elle est venue , grosse et braillante  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3765Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3765Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3765Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3765Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Elle est venue , grosse et braillante </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Elle [v|est venue|venir|is] , [a|grosse|gros|aasnmnnC] et [a|braillante|braillant|aasnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3765Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>est venue</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3765Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>grosse</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#gros" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3765Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>braillante</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#braillant" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3766"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3766Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3784" /><gams:textualContent>L'Univers rentre en transformation.Les transformations vont bien plus vite que l'on peut y croire.En évolution tout est en accéléré.C'est après que tout se stabilise et vient lent  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3766Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3766Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3766Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tout se stabilise et vient lent </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tout se stabilise et [v|vient|venir|is] [a|lent|lent|auvntnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3766Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3766Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>lent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lent" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3767"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3767Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3785" /><gams:textualContent>Étudie en science humaine au Cégep Lionel-Groulx, à Ste-Thérèse.Mais ne sachant pas vers quel domaine se diriger.Ça s'en vient , lent mais surment !</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3767Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3767Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3767Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ça s'en vient , lent mais surment</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ça [v|s'en vient|venir|rs] , [a|lent|lent|auvntnnC] mais surment</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3767Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s'en vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3767Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>lent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lent" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3768"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3768Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3786" /><gams:textualContent>Vous vous souvenez peut être de l'affaire Zara kazemi cette journaliste irano-canadienne morte dans une prison iranienne.L'iran qui comme Cuba ne reconnait pas la double nationalité, n'a jamais accepté que les canadiens viennent lent leur dire quoi faire.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3768Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3768Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3768Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les canadiens viennent lent leur dire quoi faire</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les canadiens [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|lent|lent|auvntnnn] leur dire quoi faire</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3768Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3768Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>lent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lent" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3769"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3769Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3787" /><gams:textualContent>En suivant le regard de Thibaud Croisy, impavide, jusqu’au bout d’une perspective sans fin, on devine à nouveau Sophie Demeyer à sa posture.Alors elle vient lente  , elle hante… </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3769Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3769Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3769Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle vient lente </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|vient|venir|is] [a|lente|lent|aavntnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3769Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3769Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>lente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#lent" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3770"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3770Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3788" /><gams:textualContent>Ce document explique en 3 pages comment activer son compte lorsque l'on est nouveau  venu à l'université, comment se connecter à l'E.N.T et comment retrouver ses codes d'accès en cas d'oubli.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3770Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3770Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3770Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>on est nouveau  venu à l'université</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>on est [a|nouveau|nouveau|auvnmnnn]  [v|venu|venir|is] à l'université</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3770Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venu</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3770Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>nouveau</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#nouveau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3771"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3771Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3789" /><gams:textualContent>Elfik est nouveau  venu sur la scène rock celtique, formé en 2011, le groupe mélange la musique traditionnelle aux instruments classique du rock pour soutenir ses textes tantôt engagés, tantôt simple chanson de comptoir.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3771Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3771Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3771Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Elfik est nouveau  venu sur la scène</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Elfik est [a|nouveau|nouveau|auvnmnnn]  [v|venu|venir|is] sur la scène</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3771Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venu</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3771Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>nouveau</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#nouveau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3772"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3772Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3792" /><gams:textualContent>Aby, ça ressemble beaucoup à des coliques.Mia en a eu beaucoup jusqu'à 4 mois.C'est souvent aux mêmes heures et le soir.Ils viennent raide  , se tordent, pleurent, c'est très douloureux pour eux, c'est un peu comme des gaz.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3772Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3772Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3772Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ils viennent raide </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ils [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|raide|raide|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3772Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3772Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>raide</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3773"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3773Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3793" /><gams:textualContent>Les muscles viennent raide  , difficile à se plier/déplier, marcher, lever la jambe.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3773Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3773Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3773Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Les muscles viennent raide </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Les muscles [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|raide|raide|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3773Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3773Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>raide</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3774"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3774Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3794" /><gams:textualContent>Moi, je ne peux pas parler à mon travail, mais, les cheveux me viennent raides sur la tête des fois, mais qu'est-ce que vous voulez?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3774Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3774Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3774Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les cheveux me viennent raides sur la tête</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les cheveux me [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|raides|raide|aisnmnnn] sur la tête</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3774Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3774Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>raides</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3775"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3775Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3795" /><gams:textualContent>Le prix je ne m en souviens pas, mais lésine pas sur un tube de qualité.Les maudits tubes cheaps qui viennent raides  beurk..</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3775Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3775Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3775Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Les maudits tubes cheaps qui viennent raides </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Les maudits tubes cheaps qui [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|raides|raide|aisnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3775Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3775Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>raides</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#raide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3776"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3776Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3796" /><gams:textualContent>les twins s'en viennent rapide  dans le prostock 1000. sur des pistes courtes il vont finir par avoir l'avantage.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3776Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3776Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3776Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les twins s'en viennent rapide </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les twins [v|s'en viennent|venir|rs] [a|rapide|rapide|auvntnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3776Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s'en viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3776Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rapide</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rapide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3777"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3777Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3797" /><gams:textualContent>Certaines personnes entrent dans nos vies, vont et viennent rapide et féroce  , comme des motos-taxi.D'autres nous surprennent par leur gentillesse et leur bienveillance, offrant simplement leur amitié sans date de péremption.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3777Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3777Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3777Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3777Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Certaines personnes entrent dans nos vies, vont et viennent rapide et féroce </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Certaines personnes entrent dans nos vies, vont et [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|rapide|rapide|ausntnnC] et [a|féroce|féroce|ausnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3777Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3777Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rapide</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rapide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3777Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>féroce</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#féroce" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3798" /><gams:textualContent>Internet, c’est la bonne fée, la marraine de « Vivre à Gouéné ».Les mails vont et viennent , rapides , efficaces  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Les mails vont et viennent , rapides , efficaces </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Les mails [v|vont|aller|is] et [v|viennent|venir|is] , [a|rapides|rapide|aisntnnC] , [a|efficaces|efficace|aisnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vont</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#aller" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>rapides</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#rapide" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Time" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3778Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>efficaces</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#efficace" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3779"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3779Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3799" /><gams:textualContent>Et bien sûr pour faire des points au classement de la Coupe FÉÉCUM, et pour une des équipes, d'aussi gagner une œuvre crée par notre propre VP interne, Emilie Haché qui prend justement un cours d'art visuel présentement.En tout cas, ça s'en vient serré  !Huit équipes s'étaient inscrites à l'événement, mais trois ont été portées disparues au vernissage.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3779Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3779Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3779Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça s'en vient serré </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|s'en vient|venir|rs] [a|serré|serré|auvnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3779Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s'en vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3779Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>serré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serré" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3780"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3780Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3800" /><gams:textualContent>Les chandails 18 mois font bien...Mais ça s'en vient serré avec la bedaine!</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3780Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3780Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3780Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ça s'en vient serré avec la bedaine</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ça [v|s'en vient|venir|rs] [a|serré|serré|auvnlnnn] avec la bedaine</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3780Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s'en vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3780Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>serré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serré" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3781"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3781Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3801" /><gams:textualContent>La vendeuse m'avait recommander de prendre des 7, car en 2 mois, elle a passé de 3 à 4. Et déjà-là, ses souleirs s'en viennent serré  , donc je crois bien devoir lui en acheté d'autre pour Noël.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3781Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3781Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3781Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ses souleirs s'en viennent serré </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ses souleirs [v|s'en viennent|venir|rs] [a|serré|serré|ausnlnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3781Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s'en viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3781Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>serré</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serré" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3782"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3782Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3802" /><gams:textualContent>Tramontanne explique bien pour les bas de contention.ex:ce qui est mauvais, ce sont les mi-bas que l'on porte sous les pantalons et qui viennent serrés juste sous le genou..</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3782Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3782Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3782Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui viennent serrés juste sous le genou</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui [v|viennent|venir|is] [a|serrés|serré|aisnmnnn] juste sous le genou</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3782Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>viennent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3782Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>serrés</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serré" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3783"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3783Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3803" /><gams:textualContent>Alors ainsi, les fiers Requetes, les beaux éphèbes phalangistes, les fidèles Moros (tu parles) s'en vinrent triomphant  sauver l'Espagne éternelle du chaos ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3783Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3783Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3783Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les fidèles Moros (tu parles) s'en vinrent triomphant </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les fidèles Moros (tu parles) [v|s'en vinrent|venir|is] [a|triomphant|triomphant|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3783Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s'en vinrent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3783Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>triomphant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#triomphant" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3784"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3784Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3804" /><gams:textualContent>Quelque dix jours plus tard, le vendeur s’en vient , triomphant , à l’étude, en brandissant la feuille de TPI bien connue, imprimée de vert: </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3784Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3784Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3784Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le vendeur s’en vient , triomphant , à l’étude</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le vendeur [v|s’en vient|venir|rs] , [a|triomphant|triomphant|ausnmnnn] , à l’étude</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3784Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>s’en vient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Reflexive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3784Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>triomphant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#triomphant" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3785"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3785Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3805" /><gams:textualContent>Le voilà qui vient, triomphant , majestueux  , il arrive d’un pas assuré.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3785Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3785Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3785Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3785Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>Le voilà qui vient, triomphant , majestueux </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Le voilà qui [v|vient,|venir|is] [a|triomphant|triomphant|ausnmnnC] , [a|majestueux|majestueux|ausnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3785Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vient,</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3785Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>triomphant</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#triomphant" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3785Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>majestueux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#majestueux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3786"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3786Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3806" /><gams:textualContent>En général elle s'en tire bien, mais là elle venait "triomphante"  elle est reparti la queue entre les jambes.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3786Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3786Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3786Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle venait \"triomphante\" </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|venait|venir|is] [a|\"triomphante\"|triomphant|aasnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3786Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>venait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3786Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>\"triomphante\"</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#triomphant" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3787"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3787Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3807" /><gams:textualContent>Il vente fort chez moi</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3787Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3787Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3787Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Il vente fort chez moi</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Il [v|vente|venter|is] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] chez moi</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3787Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3787Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3788"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3788Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3808" /><gams:textualContent>Selon des recherches en psychologie, des vents supérieurs à 40-50 km/h déclencheraient des instincts primaires chez les humains, comme une impulsion urgente de se braquer ou de chercher un abri.Bref, le corps réagit comme s'il subissait une attaque quand il vente fort  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3788Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3788Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3788Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>il vente fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il [v|vente|venter|is] [a|fort|fort|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3788Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3788Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3789"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3789Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3809" /><gams:textualContent>Lorsqu'il vente fort, tres fort  , le temps est propice a la chasse fine, est-ce que vous callez quand meme en vous deplacant ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3789Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3789Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3789Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>il vente fort, tres fort </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>il [v|vente|venter|is] fort, tres [a|fort|fort|auvmqrnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3789Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#venter" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3789Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>fort</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#fort" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3790"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3790Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3810" /><gams:textualContent>Mark Wahlberg est beau  vêtu de son costume pour les 22ème "Annual Producers Guild awards" à Beverly Hills</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3790Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3790Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3790Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Mark Wahlberg est beau  vêtu de son costume</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Mark Wahlberg est [a|beau|beau|ausnmnnn]  [v|vêtu|vêtir|ts] de son costume</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3790Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vêtu</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vêtir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3790Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>beau</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3791"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3791Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3811" /><gams:textualContent>En effet, à cause du froid on s’emmitoufle dans plusieurs couches de vêtements qui nous procureront un peu de chaleur, puis on boucle la tenue avec une veste bien épaisse pour dire stop au froid.Mais honnêtement, vous trouvez-vous beau  vêtu  de cette façon ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3791Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3791Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3791Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>vous trouvez-vous beau  vêtu </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>vous trouvez-vous [a|beau|beau|ausnmnnn]  [v|vêtu|vêtir|ts] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3791Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vêtu</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vêtir" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aai