:text>justes</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#juste" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3866" /><gams:textualContent>Au-delà du symptôme existent des problèmes de vie non résolus, alors le corps dit tout haut ce que l'être vit tout bas  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>le corps dit tout haut ce que l'être vit tout bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le corps [v|dit|dire|ts] tout [a|haut|haut|auvmmnnn] ce que l'être [v|vit|vivre|ts] tout [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>vit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3846Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3847"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3847Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3867" /><gams:textualContent>Gibbula umbilicalis est une des espèces appartenant à la famille des Trochidae que l’on rencontre communément sur l’estran.L’espèce vit plus bas que Osilinus lineatus et on la trouve au niveau de mi-marée.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3847Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3847Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3847Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>L’espèce vit plus bas que Osilinus lineatus</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>L’espèce [v|vit|vivre|is] plus [a|bas|bas|auvmlnnn] que Osilinus lineatus</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3847Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3847Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3868" /><gams:textualContent>Et parce que même les méchants ont besoin d'amour, elle mélange le stand-up et le sketch, pour dire tout haut ce que l'intimité vit tout bas  , et pour incarner avec tendresse des personnages drôlissimes.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848Ph1Ve2" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>pour dire tout haut ce que l'intimité vit tout bas </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>pour [v|dire|dire|ts] tout [a|haut|haut|auvmmnnn] ce que l'intimité [v|vit|vivre|ts] tout [a|bas|bas|auvmmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>dire</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dire" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848Ph1Ve2"><aaif:text>vit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>haut</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#haut" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3848Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>bas</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#bas" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">4</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3869" /><gams:textualContent>Remarques :  Vivre  bel  se disait du fait de mener une vie agréable, sans problèmes, procurant au sujet une certaine satisfaction.Le neutre bel indique la fonction adverbiale, qui est confirmé par la coordination avec sagement.&lt;lb/&gt;Des hommes dragons, vivent caché  depuis toujours parmi les hommes.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text> Vivre  bel </aaif:text><aaif:annoText> [v|Vivre|vivre|is]  [a|bel|beau|aavnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>Vivre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>bel</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#beau" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>Des hommes dragons, vivent caché </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Des hommes dragons, [v|vivent|vivre|is] [a|caché|caché|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>vivent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3849Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>caché</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caché" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3850"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3850Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3870" /><gams:textualContent>Mon témoignage à visage découvert c’est mon choix mais ce choix à un prix je suis célibataire sans enfant si je suis seul c,est tout simplement parceque, je tombe toujours les séropositifs qui vivent caché  même à leur famille le V.I.H ma tout volé mais ma fierté c,est de vivre l, amour avec un grand A .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3850Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3850Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3850Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les séropositifs qui vivent caché </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les séropositifs qui [v|vivent|vivre|is] [a|caché|caché|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3850Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3850Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>caché</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caché" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph1" /><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph2" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3871" /><gams:textualContent>Pour vivre heureux  , les homosexuels de Sotchi vivent cachés  </gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Pour vivre heureux </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Pour [v|vivre|vivre|is] [a|heureux|heureux|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivre</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>heureux</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#heureux" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph2"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph2Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph2Ad1" /><aaif:text>les homosexuels de Sotchi vivent cachés </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les homosexuels de Sotchi [v|vivent|vivre|is] [a|cachés|caché|aisnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph2Ve1"><aaif:text>vivent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3851Ph2Ad1"><aaif:text>cachés</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caché" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3852"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3852Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3872" /><gams:textualContent>Mais la plupart d’entre eux ignorent qu’au pied des gratte-ciel, de nombreux sans-abri ont trouvé refuge.Ils vivent cachés sous la dalle, notamment dans les immenses parkings souterrains du quartier, et se fondent dans la foule la journée.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3852Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3852Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3852Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ils vivent cachés sous la dalle</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ils [v|vivent|vivre|is] [a|cachés|caché|aisnmnnn] sous la dalle</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3852Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3852Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>cachés</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#caché" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3853"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3853Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3873" /><gams:textualContent>Un village perché au sommet d'une montagne.Les reclus d'un royaume changeant, ses habitants y vivent calme et serein  à l'abri de la guerre qui fait rage plus bas dans les plaines...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3853Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3853Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3853Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3853Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>ses habitants y vivent calme et serein </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ses habitants y [v|vivent|vivre|is] [a|calme|calme|ausnmnnC] et [a|serein|serein|ausnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3853Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3853Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>calme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#calme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3853Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>serein</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serein" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3854"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3854Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3874" /><gams:textualContent>Le provocateur doit nécéssairement être puni sinon les 2 corées vivaient calme  avec leure mer jaune cad Pyong yang sache que nul n'est au-dessus de l'autre car le monde appartien à Dieu seul.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3854Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3854Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3854Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les 2 corées vivaient calme </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les 2 corées [v|vivaient|vivre|is] [a|calme|calme|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3854Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivaient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3854Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>calme</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#calme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3855"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3855Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3875" /><gams:textualContent>Les campagnes vivaient calmes  , les paysans "adoraient" leur leader vénéré, les villes proprettes et bien administrées donnaient le spectacle d'un développement humain harmonieux, en contraste avec le Vietnam en guerre depuis trente ans ou le Laos resté en léthargie.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3855Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3855Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3855Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Les campagnes vivaient calmes </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Les campagnes [v|vivaient|vivre|is] [a|calmes|calme|aisnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3855Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivaient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3855Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>calmes</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#calme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3856"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3856Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3876" /><gams:textualContent>Est-ce qu’il serait prémonitoire d’envisager un retour quasi-imminent de Constentin sur cette fameuse et mythique "île aux thésards" ...par delà les océans et où les cerfs vivent calmes et sereins  ?</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3856Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3856Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3856Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3856Ph1Ad2" /><aaif:text>les cerfs vivent calmes et sereins </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les cerfs [v|vivent|vivre|is] [a|calmes|calme|aisnmnnC] et [a|sereins|serein|aisnmnnC] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3856Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3856Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>calmes</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#calme" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3856Ph1Ad2"><aaif:text>sereins</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#serein" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">3</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#InaudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3857"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3857Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3877" /><gams:textualContent>Fait que toujours est-il que dans le village, le monde vivait content  .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3857Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3857Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3857Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le monde vivait content </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le monde [v|vivait|vivre|is] [a|content|content|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3857Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3857Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>content</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#content" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3858"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3858Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3878" /><gams:textualContent>La mélancolie du passé, quand tout le monde avait du travail et vivait content  dans l'ensemble pour la période.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3858Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3858Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3858Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>tout le monde avait du travail et vivait content </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>tout le monde avait du travail et [v|vivait|vivre|is] [a|content|content|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3858Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3858Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>content</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#content" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3859"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3859Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3879" /><gams:textualContent>Ce que je me dis aussi c'est que des personnes ayant des difficultés comme ça on toujours le courage de vivre et de se relever...ils ont la peche...et moi je suis là pour les aider....c'est trop cool...malgré tous leurs probelmes ils vivent content  , et savent apprécier les choses de la vie...ils ont l'air différent mais pas du tout...ils vivent comme ça et s'en porte bien...</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3859Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3859Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3859Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>ils vivent content </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>ils [v|vivent|vivre|is] [a|content|content|ausnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3859Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3859Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>content</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#content" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3860"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3860Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3880" /><gams:textualContent>Par exemple j'avais collé Lord Of War où la femme de nicolas cage vit contente  en pensant son mari est gentil.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3860Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3860Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3860Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>la femme de nicolas cage vit contente </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>la femme de nicolas cage [v|vit|vivre|is] [a|contente|content|aasnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3860Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3860Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>contente</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#content" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3861"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3861Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3881" /><gams:textualContent>Nous en profitons pour rappeler aux croyants que selon WMB, la mort ne nous change pas : celui qui a vécu droit  , comme notre frère Ad Placide K., s’en va au repos dans sa théophanie (dont l’épouse de Ad Placide a vu la face du corps théophanique passer à quelques instants de sa mort à l’hôpital) ;</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3861Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3861Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3861Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>celui qui a vécu droit </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>celui qui [v|a vécu|vivre|is] [a|droit|droit|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3861Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>a vécu</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3861Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3862"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3862Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3882" /><gams:textualContent>Elisabeth ne tolère point les détours dans sa vie.Elle veut mourir comme elle a vécu : tout droit et à l’heure juste.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3862Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3862Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3862Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>elle a vécu : tout droit et à l’heure juste</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>elle [v|a vécu|vivre|is] : tout [a|droit|droit|auvmmnnC] et à l’heure juste</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3862Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>a vécu</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3862Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droit</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3863"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3863Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3883" /><gams:textualContent>Je ferme les yeux, résignée, en priant pour que tout se passe vite et si possible sans douleur.Moi qui voulait partir comme j'ai vécu , droite dans mes bottes et debout sur mes deux pieds…</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3863Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3863Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3863Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>qui voulait partir comme j'ai vécu , droite dans mes bottes</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>qui voulait partir comme [v|j'ai vécu|vivre|is] , [a|droite|droit|aavnlnnn] dans mes bottes</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3863Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>j'ai vécu</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3863Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>droite</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#droit" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#AudibleInflection" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Location" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3864"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3864Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3884" /><gams:textualContent>Pour lui, au physique, c’qu’il vivait dur  surtout, c’était le déplacement : Une heure et plus de trajet ça lui faisait, au retour comme à l’aller, avant qu’il ait le vélo, Noel 1912 .</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3864Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3864Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3864Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>c’qu’il vivait dur </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>c’qu’il [v|vivait|vivre|ts] [a|dur|dur|auvnqnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3864Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivait</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Transitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3864Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>dur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Quantity" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3865"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3865Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3885" /><gams:textualContent>Ce n'est pas le type qui  a vécu dur  , avec de vrais problèmes de vie, il n'est pas fort mentalement, tu dois le détruire de l'intérieur.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3865Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3865Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3865Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>le type qui  a vécu dur </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>le type qui  [v|a vécu|vivre|is] [a|dur|dur|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3865Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>a vécu</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3865Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>dur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3866"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3866Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3886" /><gams:textualContent>Ils vivaient dur  , mangeaient des racines et buvaient de la boue pour survivre.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3866Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3866Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3866Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>Ils vivaient dur </aaif:text><aaif:annoText>Ils [v|vivaient|vivre|is] [a|dur|dur|auvnmnnn] </aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3866Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivaient</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:partOfText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</aaif:partOfText><aaif:syntacticConstruction rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Intransitive" /></aaif:Verb><aaif:Adverb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3866Ph1Ad1"><aaif:text>dur</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#dur" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">2</aaif:position><aaif:coordinated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:coordinated><aaif:morphosyntacticStructure rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Adjective" /><aaif:inflection rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Uninflected" /><aaif:attributionTarget rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Verb" /><aaif:modified rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:modified><aaif:semanticClassification rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.ontology#Manner" /><aaif:reduplicated rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:reduplicated><aaif:prepositionalPhrase rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</aaif:prepositionalPhrase></aaif:Adverb><aaif:Entry rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3867"><aaif:phrase rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3867Ph1" /><aaif:source rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb.bibl#DC3887" /><gams:textualContent>en réalité, les gens vivent durs dans leurs peaux.ici c’est pas l’escroquerie, c’est du vol qualifié tout simplement.ce sont des voleurs légalisés.</gams:textualContent><rel:isPartOf rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb" /></aaif:Entry><aaif:Phrase rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3867Ph1"><aaif:verb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3867Ph1Ve1" /><aaif:adverb rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3867Ph1Ad1" /><aaif:text>les gens vivent durs dans leurs peaux</aaif:text><aaif:annoText>les gens [v|vivent|vivre|is] [a|durs|dur|aivnmnnn] dans leurs peaux</aaif:annoText></aaif:Phrase><aaif:Verb rdf:about="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.fraweb#En3867Ph1Ve1"><aaif:text>vivent</aaif:text><aaif:lemma rdf:resource="https://gams.uni-graz.at/o:aaif.lemma#vivre" /><aaif:position rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#int">1</aaif:positi